eter, more intimate,+  and -- critically -- more *French*.++--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+  DHC II Cedrat+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+  Material                       Before    After    Delta Effect     Reason+  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+  Cedrat FCF Sicilian            10,800   10,000     -800 SOFTENED   52% -- even for cedrat, this is showing off.+  Linalyl Acetate                 1,800    1,400     -400 SOFTENED   +  Hedione                           260      218      -42 SOFTENED   Transparency doesn't need amplification.+  Petitgrain EO                   5,800    6,500     +700 BOOSTED    Cedrat needs more bridge, not less.+  Ethyl Linalool                    115       80      -35 SOFTENED   Cedrat is already sharp. Softness is dissonant.+  Hedione HC                         36       27       -9 SOFTENED   +  Romandolide                     1,200      960     -240 SOFTENED   Colder musk for a colder citrus.+  Iso E Super                       290      194      -96 SOFTENED   Mineral citrus needs less molecular padding.+  + Alpha Irone                       0        0       +0 same       Orris + mineral = my signature accord.+  + Cardamom EO                       0        0       +0 same       Cold spice for cold citrus.++  Total headspace OAV: 20,608 --> 19,687  (-4%)+  Effect: Demachy pulled back the citrus, reduced Hedione/IES/Romandolide,+  boosted Petitgrain, and added two trace materials (orris + cardamom)+  that only a perfumer would notice. The formula is quieter, more intimate,+  and -- critically -- more *French*.++--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+  DHC III Grapefruit+---------------------------------------------------------------------