le.",+        "2. **Base first:** musks, amber, balsamic, wood.",+        "3. **Heart:** Hedione (radiance), geranium, powdery, floral.",+        "4. **Top:** lavender, Dihydromyrcenol, fruity, citrus, spice.",+        "5. Top up concentrate with ethanol 96% to exactly **6.00 mL**.",+        "6. Seal; macerate **48 h minimum** before first evaluation.",+        "7. Transfer to 30 mL bottle; fill with **24.0 mL** ethanol 96%.",+        "8. Macerate finished EDP **2โ€“4 weeks**.",+        "",+        "### Layering order (base โ’ top)",+        "",+        "| Order | Material | Reason |",+        "|---|---|---|",+        "| 1 | Ethylene Brassylate, Habanolide, Romandolide "+        "| Slowest evaporators |",+        "| 2 | Galaxolide | Musk anchor |",+        "| 3 | Ambrox Super (30%) | Amber fixative |",+        "| 4 | Benzoin Resinoid (50%) | Balsamic base |",+        "| 5 | Vanillin (10%), Ethyl Vanillin, Coumarin (20%) "+        "| Sweet-hay-vanilla |",+        "| 6 | Iso E Super, Javanol, Sandalore | Wood-sandalwood body |",+        "| 7 | Alpha Isomethyl Ionone | Powdery bridge |",+        "| 8 | **Hedione** (sole radiance), Dihydrojasmone, Benzyl Acetate "+        "| Heart bloom |",+        "| 9 | Geraniol, Phenethyl Alcohol | Rose-geranium warmth |",+        "| 10 | Linalyl Acetate, Ethyl Linalool, Lavender EO | Lavender pillar |",+        "| 11 | Dihydromyrcenol | Watery-fresh facet |",+        "| 12 | Apritone (10%), Hexyl Acetate (10%), "+        "Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate | Apple chord |",+        "| 13 | Cardamom FTEC (10%), Bergamot FCF | Top spice + citrus |",+        "",+        "---",+        "",+        "## Safety & Stock Notes",+        "",+        "- **Hedione HC โ€” OUT OF STOCK.**  "+        "When restocked, rebuild from v3 recipe.",+        "- **Hedione (plain):** at the optimized dose this is the highest-volume "+        "  material in the concentrate.  Weigh carefully; it is a large but "+        "  benign addition.",+        "- **Vanillin (10% stock):** large volume by design โ€” see v3 notes on "+        "  preparing a 50% stock for easier handling.",+        "- **Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate (neat):** extreme potency; "+        "  1 ยตL error matters.",+        "- **Benzyl Acetate:** IFRA cap ~12.5% in concentrate; v3b is well under.",+        "- **Ambrox Super (30% stock):** keep neat ambroxan โค 3% in EDP.",+        "- **Cardamom FTEC (10% stock):** OAV weight uses "+        "  stock-corrected neat concentration.",+    ]++    return "\n".join(lines)+++# โ”€โ”€ Entry point โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€+def main() -> None:+    result = run_one(CONCEPT, maxiter=60, popsize=18, seed=42)++    root     = Path(__file__).parent+    json_out = root / "_opt_vol_dambre_v3b_out.json"+    json_out.write_text(+        json.dumps(result, indent=2, default=str), encoding="utf-8"+    )+    print(f"\nWrote {json_out}")++    md_out = root / "formulas/collections/Vol_dAmbre_30mL_Layton_Inspired_v3b.md"+    md_out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)+    md_out.write_text(emit_markdown(result), encoding="utf-8")+    print(f"Wrote {md_out}")+++if __name__ == "__main__":+    main()diff --git a/_opt_vol_dambre_30ml_v3c.py b/_opt_vol_dambre_30ml_v3c.pynew file mode 100644index 0000000..b7d856e--- /dev/null+++ b/_opt_vol_dambre_30ml_v3c.py@@ -0,0 +1,543 @@+"""Vol d'Ambre v3c โ€” LUXURY upgrade of v3b (still no Hedione HC).++Guard-rail-driven fixes+-----------------------+GR4/GR7  Ethyl Vanillin 0.5 โ’ 1.5 %   (headspace-active vanilla that Vanillin+                                       cannot deliver; EV ODT ~0.1 ppb,+                                       5โ€“10ร— more VP-efficient)+GR6/GR5  Lavender EO 9.0 โ’ 7.5 %      (reduce aromatic cluster over-recruit)+GR6      Dihydromyrcenol 3.5 โ’ 2.5 %  (same)+GR10     Cashmeran 1.5 % NEW          (creamy cashmere mid-dry