ve bridge).++FO substitution: Clearwood (80 ยตL, clean-earthy) replaces Patchouli FO โ€” same earthy function without heavy camphor. Vetival (30 ยตL, suede-vetiver dryness) + Nagarmortha (15 ยตL, smoky cypriol) replace Vetiver FO โ€” more sophisticated, less raw-rooty.++Amber warmth: Azarbre (80 ยตL, cedar-amber smooth) + Cashmeran (100 ยตL, textile warmth) + Labdanum 10% (100 ยตL, amber-resinous-animalic) + Benzoin 50% (150 ยตL, balsamic sweetness). Olibanum Resinoid (30 ยตL) spaces the structure with incensed transparency. Coumarin 20% (60 ยตL) + Heliotropal (30 ยตL) form the powdered-tonka accord โ€” echo of the heart's orris register.++3-axis musk accord:+- **Projection:** Romandolide (250 ยตL) โ€” best sillage musk in inventory, projects outward+- **Depth:** Ethylene Brassylate (150 ยตL) โ€” creamy-lactonic, anchors on skin + Ambrettolide 10% (80 ยตL) โ€” macrocyclic skin-wine natural, intimate warmth+- Ambrettolide also contributes the fruity-wine facet that echoes Paradisamide in the heart++**Why not Habanolide:** the register is luxury-warm-natural; Habanolide pulls toward synthetic-clean. Ambrettolide + Ethylene Brassylate produce more sophisticated skin warmth.++Projection: Ambrofix 30% (600 ยตL) โ€” crystalline projection head. Kephalis (30 ยตL) structures with minimal woody-amber power.++Chypre anchor: Evernyl (20 ยตL) locks the structure โ€” without it, the base collapses into soft amber.++---++## Summary Table++| Layer | Material | Dilution | ยตL |+|-------|----------|----------|----:|+| **Top** | Bergamot EO | neat | 300 |+| | Petitgrain EO | neat | 100 |+| | Cedrat FCF Sicilian | neat | 80 |+| | Aldehyde C10 | 1% | 80 |+| | Methyl Pamplemousse | 10% in TEC | 70 |+| | Linalyl Acetate | neat | 60 |+| | Aldehyde C11 | 1% | 60 |+| | Floralozone | 10% | 50 |+| | Aldehyde C12 MNA | 1% | 50 |+| | D-Limonene | neat | 40 |+| | Geosmin | 1% in TEC | 2 |+| **Heart** | Hedione | neat | 400 |+| | ฮฑ-Isomethyl Ionone | neat | 190 |+| | Benzyl Salicylate | neat | 2