preserving paired moves)++**v2 is no longer the preferred build for an explicitly iris-jasmine result.** It remains useful as the softer, powder-luxury branch, but the two practical routes below are better aligned to the actual brief:++1. **add-only rescue** if the original bottle is already mixed and cannot be rebuilt+2. **v3 remake** if you are mixing from scratch again and want a truer iris-jasmine center++---++# ADD-ONLY RESCUE โ€” Existing Bottle Already Mixed++**Use case:** you already mixed the original formula and want to pull it closer to an iris-jasmine perfume **without rebuilding from zero**.++**Assumption:** this rescue is aimed at the original **30 mL EDP** build from this file. Because subtraction is impossible, the fix must be **heart-heavy**: more true jasmine architecture, more iris identity, almost no extra base weight.+**Stock note:** this rescue booster has been adjusted to **not require `Alpha Irone` in hand**. The scratch-remake formulas below still keep `Alpha Irone` intentionally.++**Expected effect:** more recognisable jasmine body, more visible iris root/powder spine, less "abstract salicylate-lactonic soft floral" impression.++## How to apply it++- If the bottle is full, decant **1.00 mL** first.+- Add the **1.00 mL rescue booster** below.+- Shake thoroughly and let it settle **7-14 days** before judging.+- Final strength will move upward from the original 22% EDP into a richer EDP range. That is unavoidable with any add-only correction.++## Rescue booster โ€” 1 000 ยตL total++| # | Material | Dilution | Add (ยตL) | Role |+|---|---|---|---:|---|+| 1 | Petitgrain EO | neat | 45 | Re-architects the top and stops the heart from reading flat-soft |+| 2 | Helional | neat | 25 | Clean watery-floral air around the jasmine |+| 3 | Ethyl Safranate | neat | 5 | Metallic saffron edge so the iris does not blur |+| 4 | Hedione HC | neat | 220 | Jasmine radiance lift |+| 5 | Hedione | neat | 235 | Bulk jasmine diffusion and spread on skin |+| 6 | Cis J