edure++1. **Pre-flight.** Label the mixing beaker *IJLL-v2 30mL ยท batch YYYY-MM-DD*. Zero the balance. Wipe pipette barrels. Pre-warm crystalline materials if any have recrystallised in ampoules (Coumarin 20 %, Musk Ketone 10 % โ€” if cloudy, gently warm the bottle to 28โ€“30 ยฐC in a water bath until fully clear before dosing).+2. **Dose Step 1 (Base)** into the empty beaker in the listed order B1โ’B7. Swirl gently after every 2 additions. The base is viscous (macrocyclic musks + DPG carriers) โ€” expect a faint cloudiness until ethanol is added.+3. **Dose Step 2 (Heart)** H1โ’H9. Swirl after H3 (iris section complete), after H5 (powder section complete), and after H9 (jasmine section complete). Visual check: liquid should be pale straw-yellow, clear, with a faint powder-jasmine aroma already dominant. If you smell any medicinal / mothball / fenugreek note, **STOP** โ€” verify no indole/skatole/PCME cross-contamination on your pipette tips.+4. **Dose Step 3 (Top)** T1โ’T4 quickly (โค 60 s total). Cap the beaker immediately after T4 to prevent aldehyde flash-off. The aroma should now read as: classical bergamot-petitgrain cologne opening over a jasmine-iris heart with a powdery saffron glint.+5. **Add ethanol (E1).** Pour the 23.40 mL of Ethanol 96 % in **three portions** (โ 7.8 mL each), swirling ~15 s between portions. The liquid will clarify dramatically after the first ethanol portion as DPG-based dilutions (Alpha Irone, Musk Ketone, Ambrettolide, Ambrofix, Aldehyde C12 MNA, Coumarin) dissolve out.+6. **Weight cross-check.** Total mass should be 30.00 mL ร— ฯ โ **23.5 ยฑ 0.3 g** (ethanol dominated, ฯ โ 0.80 at 22 % concentrate). If > 24.5 g, over-dosed concentrate โ€” do not correct by adding ethanol (that changes the concentration); note and remake. If < 22.5 g, under-dosed โ€” same rule.+7. **Transfer.** Funnel or pipette the full 30 mL into the atomiser bottle. Leave โค 1 mL headspace.+8. **Maceration.** Cap, label, store in a dark cupboard at **18โ€“22 ยฐC for minimum 4 weeks**. This formula has two maceration-sensitive materials (Musk Ketone crystallises if rushed, Alpha Irone develops its full rooty-powder only after weeks) โ€” **do not evaluate before day 28**. Optimal evaluation at **day 42**; peak character at **day 90**.+9. **Shake-down schedule.**+   - Day 0 (just after mixing): aggressively top-heavy, slightly "raw" Hedione, aldehydes spiky โ’ do not evaluate.+   - Day 7: top smooths, heart still disconnected from base.+   - Day 14: first coherent reading, still slightly linear.+   - Day 28: full-spectrum character present, ready for first serious evaluation.+   - Day 42: drydown reaches its final shape (Ambrettolide + Coumarin + Hexyl Sal trio fused).+   - Day 90: peak โ€” the complexion-silk character is fully rounded.++## Micro-Dose Tolerance Budget (30 mL batch)++| Dose range | Acceptable pipetting error |+|------------|----------------------------|+| Ultralia 26.2 ยตL, Cis Jasmone 28.4 ยตL, Ethyl Safranate 32.6 ยตL | ยฑ 2 ยตL (use 100 ยตL positive-displacement pipette, single aspiration) |+| ฮณ-Undecalactone 74.2 ยตL | ยฑ 3 ยตL |+| Orivone 116.3 ยตL, Benzyl Acetate 134.6 ยตL, Aldehyde C12 MNA 196.3 ยตL, Petitgrain 196.1 ยตL, Heliotropal 211.1 ยตL, Musk Ketone 229.0 ยตL, Exaltolide 261.7 ยตL, Ambrettolide 261.7 ยตL, ฮฑ-Isomethyl Ionone 278.3 ยตL | ยฑ 5 ยตL |+| Coumarin 344.2 ยตL, Ambrofix 410.5 ยตL, Bergamot 425.5 ยตL | ยฑ 10 ยตL |+| Alpha Irone 602.4 ยตL, Ebanol 607.7 ยตL, Hexyl Sal 719.8 ยตL | ยฑ 15 ยตL |+| Hedione HC 1 443.2 ยตL | ยฑ 30 ยตL |+| Ethanol 23 400 ยตL | ยฑ 100 ยตL (use 5 mL graduated pipette, 5 pulls) |++## Safety & Handling++- **Ethanol 96 %** โ€” flammable; work away from open flame; ventilate.+- **Coumarin** โ€” IFRA Cat 4 cap โ 0.6 % in leave-on skin products. This 30 mL batch contains 68.8 ยตL active Coumarin in 30 mL EDP = **0.23 % of EDP by mass** โ’ compliant.+- **Bergamot FCF** โ€” "FCF" is furocoumarin-free; no bergapten phototoxicity concern at this dose.+- **Musk