f floor of 2 800 ยตL was hit exactly โ€” meaning the optimizer shaved every ยตL of jasmine mass it was allowed to.++**v3 protections added:**+1. **Jasmine chord floor raised 2 800 โ’ 3 400 ยตL** (31 % of concentrate minimum โ€” enough to keep jasmine as *co-lead flower* rather than radiance-veil)+2. **Petitgrain EO capped at 220 ยตL** (down from the 327 ยตL v2 settled at โ€” prevents citrus-green architecture from over-stating)+3. **Baseline jasmine chord pre-strengthened to 3 431 ยตL** (Hedione HC 2 530 โ’ 2 870; balanced by Bergamot โ’115, Hexyl Sal โ’75, Ambrofix โ’150)++### Axis deltas โ€” v1 vs v2 vs v3++| Axis | v1 | v2 | v3 | ฮ” v2โ’v3 | Reading |+|------|:--:|:--:|:--:|:-------:|---------|+| hedonic            | 86.7 | 86.7 | **87.1** | +0.4 | **brief-alignment axis rewards jasmine restoration** |+| texture            | 73.1 | 73.8 | 73.7 | โ’0.1 | flat |+| luxury             | 59.3 | 64.4 | **59.4** | โ’5.0 | **sacrificed to protect jasmine** โ€” expected |+| stacking_depth     | 68.0 | 68.0 | 68.0 | 0    | flat |+| skin_performance   | 72.9 | 74.4 | 72.0 | โ’2.4 | cushion trimmed (Hexyl Sal โ’95) |+| longevity          | 67.0 | 68.5 | 67.3 | โ’1.2 | base slightly lighter |+| sillage            | 64.2 | 64.2 | 64.1 | flat | |+| synergy            | 60.0 | 60.0 | 60.0 | flat | |+| photorealism       | 86.9 | 87.9 | 87.1 | โ’0.8 | |+| perceptual_clarity | 87.9 | 87.8 | 88.2 | +0.4 | jasmine-chord coherence sharpens |+| **composite geo**  | 70.39 | 71.97 | **70.81** | **โ’1.16** | luxury tradeoff made intentionally |++**Takeaway:** v3 gives up โ’1.16 composite geo (mostly luxury) in exchange for **+0.4 hedonic** (the true brief-alignment axis) and, crucially, a jasmine chord that no longer hits its floor from above โ€” v3 has headroom for future formula tweaks without losing jasmine identity.++### Chord signal audit โ€” v1 / v2 / v3++| Signal | v1 ยตL (%) | v2 ยตL (%) | **v3 ยตL (%)** | v3 vs v2 |+|--------|:---------:|:---------:|:-------------:|:--------:|+| **Jasmine chord** (Hedione HC + Benzyl Acetate + Cis Jasmone + ฮณ-Und) | 3 091 (28.1 %) | 2 800 (25.5 %) | **3 403 (30.9 %)** | **+21.5 %** |+| **Iris chord** (Alpha Irone + Orivone + ฮฑ-IMI + Ultralia) | 1 969 (17.9 %) | 1 705 (15.5 %) | **1 701 (15.5 %)** | flat |+| Hedione HC alone | 2 530 (23.0 %) | 2 405 (21.9 %) | **2 846 (25.9 %)** | +18 % |+| Benzyl Acetate | 308 | 224 | **305** | restored |+| ฮณ-Undecalactone | 165 | 124 | **164** | restored |+| Petitgrain EO (arch.) | 165 | 327 | **174** | halved back |+| Heliotropal (iris-powder) | 275 | 352 | **334** | slightly trimmed |++**Iris:jasmine ratio โ€” v3:** 1 701 / 3 403 = **0.500** (v1: 0.637, v2: 0.609) โ€” the duet is now *more* jasmine-weighted than even v1, but iris still holds 15.5 % of the concentrate and 2.73 % active Alpha Irone. Both flowers clearly co-lead.++### v3 mass fractions (% w/w of concentrate, density โ 1.0)++| # | Ingredient | Dilution | mass_frac % | active_frac % | Role |+|---|-----------|:--------:|:-----------:|:-------------:|------|+|T1 | Bergamot FCF oil Sicilian | neat | 6.18 | 6.18 | hesperidic lift |+|T2 | Petitgrain EO | neat | 1.58 | 1.58 | green-citrus arch (capped) |+|T3 | Aldehyde C12 MNA | 1 % | 2.98 | 0.030 | aldehyde sparkle |+|T4 | Ethyl Safranate | neat | 0.31 | 0.31 | saffron trace |+|H1 | **Hedione HC** | neat | **25.87** | **25.87** | jasmine-radiance carrier (pillar) |+|H2 | Cis Jasmone | neat | 0.79 | 0.79 | jasmine-ketone signal |+|H3 | Benzyl Acetate | neat | 2.78 | 2.78 | jasmine-fruity lift |+|H4 | ฮณ-Undecalactone | neat | 1.49 | 1.49 | lactonic peach-jasmin bridge |+|H5 | **Alpha Irone** | 30 % DEP | **9.12** | **2.73** | iris-root depth (pillar) |+|H6 | ฮฑ-Isomethyl Ionone | neat | 4.20 | 4.20 | ionone violet-iris echo |+|H7 | Orivone | neat | 1.75 | 1.75 | orris-butter core |+|H8 | Heliotropal | neat | 3.03 | 3.03 | clean-powder luxury |+|H9 | Ultralia | neat | 0.40 | 0.40 | trace iris-ghost |+|B1 | **Hexyl Salicylate** | neat | **10.04** 