7ยทiยทm and not v7 or v8:** v7 won the composite decisively but omitted the one molecule every real jasmine absolute carries (Indole, ~2.5 % of natural jasmine headspace). v8 added Indole and pushed the jasmine-defense floor โ€” which cost 6.1 sillage points by displacing diffusive top-mass. **v7ยทiยทm adds Indole at the v8-proven survival dose (30 ยตL of 10 % = 3.0 ยตL active = 0.027 % of concentrate)** funded by a โ’30 ยตL reduction of Hedione std.++**Exaltolide substitution โ€” the perfumery truth:** bench inventory lacks Exaltolide, but the substitution is *not* simply "replace with another musk." In iris compositions, Exaltolide serves a **dual function**: (a) macrocyclic-musk skin-warmth, (b) orris-butter waxy-fatty-texture mimic (the C15 lactone shares tactile territory with the C14 fatty acid that dominates real orris butter). The character-correct substitution is therefore **Myristic Acid** โ€” literally the molecule that is ~85 % of natural orris butter's non-volatile fraction โ€” plus a modest macrocyclic-musk supplement to cover the warmth axis Exaltolide's ring system contributed. **Myristic Acid 45 mg = 0.68 % w/w of concentrate** sits in the textbook orris-butter-texture window (0.3โ€“1.0 %; below that, no texture effect; above 1.0 %, reads as cold-cream soap and flattens iris shimmer). The 435.3 ยตL liquid mass is redistributed across Habanolide neat 150 ยตL + EB +145 ยตL + Ambrettolide 10 % +140.3 ยตL. Liquid ฮฃ concentrate remains 6 600 ยตL; Myristic Acid is added as a **weighed solid**, dissolved in the warm Ebanol/Hexyl Salicylate base at 40 ยฐC water-bath before other base materials. No re-optimization โ€” this is a locked hand build.++## v7ยทi Concentrate Dosing โ€” 30 mL EDP @ 22 % (6.60 mL concentrate + 23.40 mL Ethanol 96ยฐ)++All values in **ยตL of as-bottled material**. ฮฃ concentrate = **6 600.0 ยตL**. Density โ 1.0 g/mL โ’ 6.60 g concentrate + 18.72 g ethanol (density 0.80) โ 25.32 g total.++### Section A โ€” BASE (dispense FIRST, i