ongs in a garden. This is Diptyque's garden." |+| **Polysantol** | 0.50% | kept | "Sandalwood cream under oakmoss โ€” this IS our base." |++31 materials. Same concept, different setting. The lullaby moved from cinema to garden.++---++## VARIANT โ€” Roja Dove (37 materials ยท luxury ยท "Haute Lullaby")++**Philosophy:** "If you're going to quote Guerlain, quote it with the best materials you own." Roja Dove doesn't change the architecture. He upgrades the ingredients. Every molecule gets the luxury treatment.++| Change | From | To | Why |+|---|---|---|+| **Bergamot** | Sicilian | double dose: Sicilian 3% + **Bergamot FCF** 3% | Two bergamots. "Citrus should never be one-dimensional." |+| **Jasmine body** | DBCA 1.50% | DBCA 1.00% + **Jasmine Absolute 10%** 80 ยตL | "Gardenia is not jasmine. Real jasmine is real jasmine. I keep the DBCA but I add the absolute." |+| **Rose** | PEA 1% + Geraniol 0.50% + Damascol 1% + Rose Oxide 0.15% | **Rose Absolute** 10% at 50 ยตL โ€” replace all four | "Four rose molecules? That's not luxury. That's indecision. One real rose absolute." |+| **Iris** | Alpha Irone 30% at 8% + Orivone 0.60% + Ultralia 0.20% | Alpha Irone 30% at 10% + Orivone kept + **Orris F-TEC** 2.00% | "Iris is not a molecule. It's a base. I keep the Irone, I keep the Orivone, I add real orris." |+| **Labdanum Absolute 10%** | โ€” | 2.50% | Amber depth. "You have Labdanum Absolute. Why isn't it in the base?" |+| **Musk Ketone 10%** | 6.00% | 8.00% | Louder era signal |+| **Cashmeran 20%** | 10.00% | 10.00% | "Correct. Cashmeran is the blanket. No change needed." |+| **Exaltolide 10%** | 1.00% | kept | "Five musks. Five. Not four, not six. Five is luxury." |++"This is the perfume you wrote if you had unlimited budget."++"I have Jasmine Absolute in inventory. I have Rose Absolute. I have Labdanum Absolute. I have Orris F-TEC. I just never used them in this formula."++"Then use them. You were writing Guerlain with IKEA."++---++## VARIANT โ€” Areej le Dorรฉ (28 materials