ver โ€” swirl. Black Pepper last.+4. **Dose Top** (13โ’14) โ€” โค30 seconds. Cap immediately.+5. **Add ethanol** (15) in three portions (~15 mL each). Swirl 15s between. Cloudiness clears as DPG-based dilutions dissolve.+6. **Macerate** 4 weeks minimum, 6 preferred. Dark, 18โ€“22ยฐC. Cold-filter at 4ยฐC after maceration if hazy.+7. **Spray:** 5 sprays = EDP-level skin dose.++---++## LESSONS FROM THIS BUILD++- **No embedded OAV tables in formula markdown.** The parser reads them as dosing tables and corrupts analysis.+- **Alias every material variant.** Jasmine Sambac Abs, Cedrat FCF, Vetiver EO (India) โ€” all needed explicit entries.+- **Nitriles at >0.3% of concentrate kill perception.** Lemonile at 1% blocked juniper and grapefruit. Avoid entirely or dose at trace.+- **Concentration % โ  longevity.** Ambrofix + coumarin + vetiver + musks at 7.4% outlasts citrus-hedione at 20%. The base determines wear time.+- **Juniper at #1 was the goal from the start.** It took 5 formula revisions, 4 OAV re-runs, and a nitrile disaster to get there. Worth it.++---++## LABEL++**"Night Gin โ€” 50 mL EDT โ€” 2026-05-10 โ€” Macerate 4 weeks minimum โ€” 5 sprays"**diff --git a/formulas/Seuil_du_Jour_30mL_EDC.md b/formulas/Seuil_du_Jour_30mL_EDC.mdnew file mode 100644index 0000000..0da8254--- /dev/null+++ b/formulas/Seuil_du_Jour_30mL_EDC.md@@ -0,0 +1,272 @@+# Seuil du Jour โ€” 30 mL Eau de Cologne Moderne โ€” v3 Classique++**Batch:** 30.00 mL ยท ~16.7% EdC ยท **18 materials** (5 EOs/naturals)+**Profile:** Dior Homme Cologne radical minimalism ร— the invisible luxury layer DHC omits+**Target consumer:** The DHC buyer who wants the same transparency but with a "what IS that?"+quality โ€” the difference between clean and polished.+**Maceration:** 3 weeks minimum++---++## What "Classy" Means in This Formula++v2 (13 materials) was clean, correct, minimal. But clean is not the same as classy.+Classy means:++1. **Sparkle you don't notice** โ€” Aldehyde C10 at 0.0008% active. Below identification threshold.+   Creates champagne effervescence at the opening without smelling "aldehydic."+2. **Warmth without a source** โ€” Oranger Crystals at 0.012% active. Not neroli, not orange blossom โ€”+   just a glow behind the grapefruit blossom.+3. **The rose halo** โ€” Damascenone at 0.0005% active. Not rose. Just the $400-fragrance halo.+   This is what Dior, Chanel, and Hermes put in their expensive fresh fragrances that their+   cheaper flankers omit. It's what makes you go "this smells expensive" without knowing why.+4. **Skin warmth that reads as YOU** โ€” Ambrettolide, the most naturalistic musk in inventory,+   replaces the Ebanol/Coumarin Edition Blanche reference. Instead of borrowing another fragrance's+   creaminess, it creates its own.+5. **The ghost of orris** โ€” Alpha Irone at 0.005% active. Below identification threshold.+   The classiest 10 microlitres you can add to any formula. Ellena, Sheldrake, Kurkdjian all use+   this trick โ€” a whisper of iris that no one can name but everyone can feel.+6. **Superior radiance** โ€” Hedione HC replaces some standard Hedione for cleaner jasmonate bloom.++---++## Material Upgrades from v2++| v2 material | v3 replacement | Reason |+|-------------|---------------|--------|+| Ethyl Linalool 250 ยตL | Ethyl Linalool 250 ยตL (kept) | Still correct for citrus-floral bridge |+| Ebanol 70 ยตL + Coumarin 40 ยตL | Ebanol 30 ยตL + Ambrettolide 60 ยตL | Natural skin warmth replaces tonka-sandalwood reference |+| Hedione 950 ยตL solo | Hedione 1050 ยตL + Hedione HC 100 ยตL | Superior cis-jasmonate radiance |+| โ€” | Aldehyde C10 (1%) 40 ยตL | Invisible champagne sparkle |+| โ€” | Oranger Crystals (10%) 60 ยตL | Neroli glow behind the blossom |+| โ€” | Damascenone (1%) 25 ยตL | Rose halo โ€” the $400-fragrance trick |+| โ€” | Alpha Irone (30%) 10 ยตL | Ghost of orris โ€” the ultimate class signifier |++---++## Equipment++- 1 amber glass bottle 30 mL+- 1 graduated pipette 1 mL (for 10โ€“1050 ยตL)+- 1 micro-pipette or 1 mL syringe graduated 0.01 mL (for 10โ€“40 ยตL)+- Ethanol 96% (perfumer's grade)++---++## Accord Architecture++### Layer 1 โ€” Refined Citrus Sparkle (Top, ~29% of concentrate)+Still bergamot-dominant (22% of concentrate) โ€” one citrus defines the opening, DHC-style.+Bergamot FCF Sicilian is the premium grade. Linalyl Acetate extends bergamot freshness.+Cardamom EO provides micro-aromatic lift so the opening doesn't read as "citrus cleaner."+Aldehyde C10 at 1% dilution adds champagne effervescence โ€” invisible, untraceable, essential.++### Layer 2 โ€” Luminous Blossom Heart (Heart, ~40% of concentrate)+Petitgrain EO + Paradisamide remains the grapefruit blossom core โ€” DHC's signature register.+Oranger Crystals at 60 ยตL of 10% dilution adds a neroli glow behind the blossom โ€” not a second+floral note, just warmth. Damascenone at 25 ยตL of 1% dilution creates the expensive-rose halo+that DHC lacks. Hedione + Hedione HC provide jasmonate radiance at two clarity levels โ€” standard+for volume, high-cis for brilliance. Ethyl Linalool bridges citrus-floral into the base with+woody-floral tenacity.++### Layer 3 โ€” Polished Skin Musk (Base, ~31% of concentrate)+Romandolide (projection) + Ethylene Brassylate (depth) + Ambrettolide (natural warmth) โ€”+a 3-material musk chord where each operates on a different axis. Ambrettolide is the key+classiness upgrade: it replaces v2's Ebanol + Coumarin Edition Blanche reference with a+naturalistic skin warmth that belongs to THIS fragrance, not to Allure Homme Edition Blanche.+Iso E Super at 8% is the molecular skin cocoon. Ambrofix at 3% dilution provides crystalline+mineral transparency. Ebanol at 0.6% is a whisper โ€” sandalwood as texture, not as a note.+Alpha Irone at 10 ยตL of 30% dilution (0.06% active in concentrate) is the ghost of orris โ€”+the "what IS that?" at the threshold of perception.++---++## Procedure โ€” Layer A: Base (heaviest first)++| # | Material | Dilution | ยตL | Active ยตL | Role |+|--:|----------|---