amplification, Cis Jasmone ketone, Jasmine FO body, Indole trace). The two accords are bridged by a **salicylate cushion gradient** โ€” Benzyl Salicylate (cosmetic-heavy) layered under Hexyl Salicylate (transparent-green) โ€” which is simultaneously the classical jasmine-diffusion framework and a cosmetic-powder register that echoes the orris.++Drydown: creamy-skin musk chord (Ethylene Brassylate lactonic depth + Habanolide skin warmth + Ambrettolide fruity-musky naturalism), Ebanol creamy sandalwood for silk texture, Iso E Super molecular cocoon, Ambrox Super trace mineral for transparency without crystalline cold.++**Signal shape:** short bergamot-petitgrain burst โ’ iris-jasmine co-radiance at 20 min โ’ salicylate powder bed at 2 h โ’ lactonic skin musk + creamy sandalwood at 6 h+.++## Formula++| # | Ingredient | Dilution | ยตL | mL |+|---:|---|---|---:|---:|+| | **TOP โ€” 150 ยตL** | | | |+| 1 | Bergamot FCF oil Sicilian | neat | 80 | 0.080 |+| 2 | Petitgrain EO | neat | 20 | 0.020 |+| 3 | Ethyl Linalool | neat | 40 | 0.040 |+| 4 | Aldehyde C11 undecylenic | 1 % | 10 | 0.010 |+| | **IRIS CORE โ€” 580 ยตL** | | | |+| 5 | Alpha Irone | 30 % | 260 | 0.260 |+| 6 | Alpha Ionone | neat | 30 | 0.030 |+| 7 | Beta Ionone | neat | 15 | 0.015 |+| 8 | Irotyl | neat | 25 | 0.025 |+| 9 | Orivone | neat | 80 | 0.080 |+| 10 | Ultralia | neat | 30 | 0.030 |+| 11 | Carrot Seed EO | neat | 70 | 0.070 |+| 12 | Alpha Isomethyl Ionone | neat | 35 | 0.035 |+| 13 | Dihydro Beta Ionone | neat | 5 | 0.005 |+| 14 | Violet Fleuressence | neat | 30 | 0.030 |+| | **JASMINE CORE โ€” 575 ยตL** | | | |+| 15 | Hedione | neat | 300 | 0.300 |+| 16 | Hedione HC | neat | 70 | 0.070 |+| 17 | Cis Jasmone | neat | 10 | 0.010 |+| 18 | Amyl Cinnamic Aldehyde (ACA) | neat | 40 | 0.040 |+| 19 | Benzyl Acetate | neat | 30 | 0.030 |+| 20 | Methyl Benzoate | neat | 12 | 0.012 |+| 21 | Jasmine FO | neat | 70 | 0.070 |+| 22 | Indole | 10 % | 6 | 0.006 |+| 23 | DBCA | neat | 20 | 0.020 |+| 24 | PEDMC | neat | 15 | 0.015 |+| 25 | Farnesol | neat | 2 | 0.002 |+| | **HEDONIC POWDERโ€“CREAM โ€” 80 ยตL (new)** | | | |+| 26 | Heliotropin | neat | 20 | 0.020 |+| 27 | Coumarin | 20 % | 40 | 0.040 |+| 28 | ฮณ-Undecalactone | 10 % | 20 | 0.020 |+| | **BASE / MUSK / FIXATIVE / WOODS โ€” 845 ยตL** | | | |+| 29 | Benzyl Salicylate | neat | 130 | 0.130 |+| 30 | Hexyl Salicylate | neat | 50 | 0.050 |+| 31 | Ethylene Brassylate | neat | 200 | 0.200 |+| 32 | Habanolide | neat | 80 | 0.080 |+| 33 | Ambrettolide | 10 % | 140 | 0.140 |+| 34 | Ebanol | neat | 90 | 0.090 |+| 35 | Javanol | neat | 20 | 0.020 |+| 36 | Cedarwood Virginia EO | neat | 30 | 0.030 |+| 37 | Iso E Super | neat | 50 | 0.050 |+| 38 | Ambrox Super | 30 % | 25 | 0.025 |+| 39 | Musk Ketone | 10 % | 30 | 0.030 |+| | **SUB-ODT TRACES โ€” 38 ยตL** | | | |+| 40 | Geosmin | 1 % | 3 | 0.003 |+| 41 | Isoeugenol | neat | 3 | 0.003 |+| 42 | Damascone Beta | 10 % | 7 | 0.007 |+| 43 | Heliotropal | neat | 25 | 0.025 |+| | **Ethanol 96 %** | carrier | 7 732 | 7.732 |+| | **TOTAL** | | **10 000** | **10.000** |++## Material rationale โ€” why THIS material, not alternatives++### Citrus โ€” Bergamot FCF Sicilian (not Grapefruit, not Cedrat)+Jasmine soliflores are the classical home of bergamot; its linalyl acetateโ€“linalool signature echoes and extends the Hedione radiance. Grapefruit FCF (bitter-pith dryness) would harden the iris cushion; Cedrat (bitter mineral citron) would fight the powder register. Sicilian origin chosen over regular FCF for richer top-note complexity.++### Petitgrain EO โ€” green-bitter bridge+Adds the bitter-leafy facet that lives *between* bergamot and jasmine in a classical soliflore. Reads as "green stem" rather than "green leaf" โ€” shortens the gap from citrus to indolic heart.++### Iris spine โ€” Alpha Irone 30 % (primary) + Carrot Seed EO (depth) + Orivone (base)+Alpha Irone 30 % โ’ 54 ยตL active = a real orris spine, not decoration. Carrot Seed EO is the earthy-iris backbone (proven critical in the IRL 50 mL optimization โ€” carrot seed did heavy lifting). Orivone provides the buttery-vegetal iris base. Ultralia is a ghost-iris trace at 30 ยตL. AIMI held low at 35 ยตL (per the user's iris preference and IRL spec).++### Jasmine spine โ€” Hedione + Hedione HC (not Hedione alone)+Hedione HC (high-cis) is ~4ร— the olfactive potency of regular Hedione for the jasmonate radiance register. 300 neat Hedione + 70 HC gives the soliflore volume without the HC over-sharpening the top. Cis Jasmone supplies the actual *ketone* character โ€” without it, Hedione alone is "jasmine radiance" rather than "jasmine". Benzyl Acetate + Methyl Benzoate = the jasmine ester chord. Jasmine FO as body (70 ยตL โ€” enough to read, not enough to dominate).++### Indole at trace (6 ยตL of 10 %)+Indole = 0.6 ยตL active. Below ODT for most wearers but present enough to shift the jasmine from "clean" into "real". Skatole rejected โ€” too fecal for a toile; Indole is the controlled version.++### ACA (Amyl Cinnamic Aldehyde) for jasmine body+Waxy-floral diffusant that amplifies the jasmine without adding cinnamic spice. IFRA-restricted but 40 ยตL in 10 mL = 0.4 % which is below the 0.5 % EDP guidance.++### Farnesol at 2 ยตL (trace)+Synergizes with Hedione for neroli-lily depth under the jasmine. Above 5 ยตL risks the waxy-rancid overdose register.++### Salicylate gradient โ€” Benzyl Sal (heavy) + Hexyl Sal (transparent)+Not a choice, a structure. Benzyl Salicylate 130 ยตL = the cosmetic-floral diffusion cushion every classical jasmine sits on. Hexyl Salicylate 50 ยตL layered above = green-floral transparency that keeps the cushion from reading as "old-school". Benzyl Benzoate rejected โ€” it is a character-free fixative and the salicylate *character* is wanted here.++### Musk chord โ€” 3 axes+- **Depth (lactonic):** Ethylene Brassylate 150 โ€” creamy skin-body, echoes the iris butter+- **Projection / warmth:** Habanolide 80 โ€” warm skin-trail (chosen over Romandolide because this toile wants intimacy