95 | Single direction (no green/leather/smoke intrusions) |+| Hedonic | 85+ | Powder-cream-floral = classical pleasure-accord |++## Next steps++1. Mix the toile and evaluate 24 h dry-down.+2. If radiance reads thin โ’ boost Hedione HC first, then ACA.+3. If iris is swallowed by jasmine โ’ increase Alpha Irone 30 % toward 240 ยตL.+4. If drydown reads synthetic โ’ increase Ambrettolide (the naturalistic musk).+5. Run an `_opt_iris_jasmine_toile_10mL.py` convergence pass once the toile is approved.++## Rejected alternatives (recorded)++- **Ylang Comoros Complete** โ€” would add a banana-solar facet that competes with the jasmine ester chord. Save for a separate "solar floral" concept.+- **PEA (Phenethyl Alcohol)** โ€” rose-honey; would pull the heart toward rose rather than jasmine-iris.+- **Neroli EO** โ€” orange-blossom is adjacent but its terpenic facet clashes with the carrot-seed earthiness.+- **Benzyl Benzoate** โ€” character-free; the salicylate CHARACTER is wanted, not invisible fixation.+- **Javanol** โ€” too cold-dry for a warm-creamy iris-jasmine.+- **Coumarin / Vanillin / Benzoin** โ€” would push toward Iris Rรชverie Lactรฉe cream-drydown territory. This toile is the *non-gourmand* iris-jasmine.+- **Methyl Pamplemousse / Grapefruit FCF / Cedrat** โ€” citrus alternatives that would harden the composition.+- **Evernyl** โ€” would turn the toile into a jasmine-chypre; out of scope.+- **Mayol / Lilyreal / Bourgeonal** โ€” muguet materials; they belong in IRL's cosmetic-muguet heart, not a jasmine toile.diff --git a/formulas/collections/Iris_Reverie_Lactee_10mL.md b/formulas/collections/Iris_Reverie_Lactee_10mL.mdnew file mode 100644index 0000000..3bd1c79--- /dev/null+++ b/formulas/collections/Iris_Reverie_Lactee_10mL.md@@ -0,0 +1,188 @@+# Iris Rรชverie Lactรฉe++**Batch:** 10.00 mL EDP ยท **Concentrate:** 23.34 % (2 334 ยตL) ยท **Ethanol 96 %:** 7.67 mL+**Character:** Soft iris powder โ’ hydroxycitronellal muguet white floral โ’ coumarin-vanillin-heliotropin-lactone cream. A dreamy single-direction synergy: every register is warm, soft, sweet-powder-creamy; no angular breaks. AIMI kept low (user spec). Sub-ODT traces (Geosmin, Indole, Damascol, Aurantiol, Isoeugenol) add hedonic depth and textural complexity beneath the audible structure.++**Single direction:** powdery-muguet-creamy-vanillic-heliotropinic. No green/galbanum bomb. No leather/smoke. No bright citrus aldehyde. No oakmoss. The whole composition resolves as ONE perfume, not top+heart+base stacked.++---++## Formula++| # | Ingredient | Dilution | Amount (ยตL) | Amount (mL) |+|---|-----------|----------|-------------:|-------------:|+| **TOP โ€” minimal dreamy fan (we do not want sparkle)** | | | | |+| 1 | Bergamot FCF oil Sicilian | neat | 50 | 0.050 |+| 2 | Ethyl Linalool | neat | 30 | 0.030 |+| 3 | Scentenal | 1 % | 5 | 0.005 |+| **IRIS POWDER CORE โ€” the hero register** | | | | |+| 4 | Alpha Irone | 30 % in DEP | 180 | 0.180 |+| 5 | Alpha Ionone | neat | 25 | 0.025 |+| 6 | Beta Ionone | neat | 8 | 0.008 |+| 7 | Irotyl | neat | 25 | 0.025 |+| 8 | Orivone | neat | 45 | 0.045 |+| 9 | Ultralia | neat | 25 | 0.025 |+| 10 | Carrot Seed EO | neat | 20 | 0.020 |+| 11 | Alpha Isomethyl Ionone | neat | 40 | 0.040 |+| 12 | Musk Ketone | 10 % in DPG | 80 | 0.080 |+| **WHITE FLORAL HEART โ€” hydroxycitronellal muguet register** | | | | |+| 13 | Hydroxycitronellal | neat | 70 | 0.070 |+| 14 | Mayol | neat | 35 | 0.035 |+| 15 | Lilyreal ND | neat | 25 | 0.025 |+| 16 | Bourgeonal | neat | 10 | 0.010 |+| 17 | DBCA | neat | 30 | 0.030 |+| 18 | Freesia HDI | neat | 20 | 0.020 |+| 19 | PEDMC | neat | 20 | 0.020 |+| 20 | Hedione | neat | 280 | 0.280 |+| 21 | Hedione HC | neat | 40 | 0.040 |+| 22 | Farnesol | neat | 2 | 0.002 |+| **CREAM / HELIOTROPIN / COUMARIN / VANILLIN / LACTONE โ€” luxury drydown** | | | | |+| 23 | Heliotropal (Piperonal) | neat | 50 | 0.050 |+| 24 | Coumarin | 20 % in ethanol | 200 | 0.200 |+| 25 | Vanillin | 10 % in ethanol | 120 | 0.120 |+| 26 | Ethyl Vanillin | neat | 5 | 0.005 |+| 27 | Ethyl Maltol | 10 % in ethanol | 40 | 0.040 |+| 28 | Anisaldehyde | neat | 8 | 0.008 |+| 29 | Gamma Undecalactone | neat | 12 | 0.012 |+| 30 | Delta Decalactone | neat | 10 | 0.010 |+| 31 | Benzoin Resinoid | 50 % in DPG | 60 | 0.060 |+| **MUSK / FIXATIVE / STRUCTURAL COCOON** | | | | |+| 32 | Benzyl Salicylate | neat | 140 | 0.140 |+| 33 | Hexyl Salicylate | neat | 60 | 0.060 |+| 34 | Ethylene Brassylate | neat | 150 | 0.150 |+| 35 | Exaltolide | 10 % in DPG | 80 | 0.080 |+| 36 | Ambrettolide | 10 % in DPG | 60 | 0.060 |+| 37 | Habanolide | neat | 70 | 0.070 |+| 38 | Ebanol | neat | 55 | 0.055 |+| 39 | Iso E Super | neat | 90 | 0.090 |+| 40 | Ambrox Super | 30 % in DPG | 30 | 0.030 |+| **SUB-ODT COMPLEXITY TRACES โ€” hedonic texture under the threshold** | | | | |+| 41 | Aurantiol | neat | 5 | 0.005 |+| 42 | Damascol | 10 % in DPG | 15 | 0.015 |+| 43 | Geosmin | 1 % in TEC | 3 | 0.003 |+| 44 | Indole | 10 % in DPG | 3 | 0.003 |+| 45 | Isoeugenol | neat | 3 | 0.003 |+| **CONCENTRATE SUBTOTAL** | | | **2 334** | **2.334** |+| 46 | Ethanol 96 % | carrier | 7 666 | 7.666 |+| **TOTAL** | | | **10 000** | **10.000** |++---++## Accord Architecture โ€” Why Each Material++### TOP โ€” deliberately minimal (85 ยตL total, 3.6 % of concentrate)+A dreamy opening requires restraint. A bright aldehydic/hesperidic top would break the powder-cream direction before the iris speaks.++- **Bergamot FCF Sicilian (50 ยตL)** โ€” chosen over 8 citrus alternatives. Rejected: Grapefruit FCF (bitter pink-pith dryness would clash with cream), Cedrat (too sharp-mineral), D-Limonene (fleeting terpenic burst, no diffusion), Red Mandarin (warm-tangerine pulls gourmand-oriental, not dreamy), Terpinyl Acetate (pine-herbal breaks direction), Methyl Pamplemousse (synthetic-tart, wrong register), plain Bergamot FCF (too light-cologne). Sicilian FCF gives RICHER bergamot character at LOWER dose โ€” a whispered fan, not a citrus announcement.+- **Ethyl Linalool (30 ยตL)** โ€” softer, more woody-floral and more tenacious than Linalool; bridges citrus fan into iris-woody heart without leaving a bare gap.+- **Scentenal 1 % (5 ยตL โ’ 0.05 ยตL active)** โ€” sub-ODT ozonic-metallic transparency trace. Adds "dreamy" air under the powder without contributing an audible ozone note.++### IRIS POWDER CORE โ€” 448 ยตL, 19.2 % of concentrate+The hero register. All 9 iris/violet materials deployed across different texture axes.++- **Alpha Irone 30 % (180 ยตL โ’ 54 ยตL active)** โ€” THE orris hero. Most expensive iris material in inventory; chosen because only Alpha Irone delivers the authentic Mysore-orris deep-powder-butter character. Ionones alone read as "violet-candy"; irone reads as "iris absolute".+- **Alpha Ionone (25 ยตL)** โ€” round, warm, rosy-violet โ€” softens the precision of Alpha Irone.+- **Beta Ionone (8 ยตL)** โ€” powdery-woody orris echo at trace, widens the iris spectrum without adding a violet candy sweetness.+- **Irotyl (25 ยตL)** โ€” sweet-irone carrier, bridges iris โ’ cream register beneath the audible powder.+- **Orivone (45 ยตL)** โ€” buttery-iris structural base. **Critical bridge material:** Orivone is the single molecule that seamlessly connects iris powder to the creamy-lactonic drydown. Without it the iris would sit above the cream instead of melting into it.+- **Ultralia (25 ยตL)** โ€” ghost iris at trace concentration, powdery transparency carrier; widens the halo of the iris.+- **Carrot Seed EO (20 ยตL)** โ€” natural carrot-iris bridge; adds a faint earthiness that grounds the synthetic iris chord without breaking dreaminess.+- **Alpha Isomethyl Ionone (40 ยตL)** โ€” kept LOW per user spec. Adds a light violet-iris powder volume and an AIMI "cosmetic-ghost" signature but never becomes the centerpiece.+- **Musk Ketone 10 % (80 ยตL โ’ 8 ยตL active)** โ€” THE powder-axis musk. Chosen specifically because Musk Ketone is the only musk in inventory that directly reinforces a powdery register. Rejected as primary musks here: Habanolide (no powder contribution), Galaxolide (synthetic-laundry clash), Romandolide (projects outward โ€” wrong for intimate iris powder). Musk Ketone is the *character-echo* musk in this formula.++### WHITE FLORAL HEART โ€” 532 ยตL, 22.8 % of concentrate+Hydroxycitronellal register (muguet / white lily / gardenia), kept CLEAN and transparent โ€” this is the "dreamy" white-flower cloud that floats between iris and cream.++- **Hydroxycitronellal (70 ยตL)** โ€” THE muguet-white-lily signature molecule, the hydroxycitronellal register the user explicitly requested.+- **Mayol (35 ยตL)** โ€” post-Lyral muguet; cleaner, fresher muguet character than Hydroxycitronellal alone. Together Mayol + Hydroxycitronellal + Bourgeonal build a full muguet chord.+- **Lilyreal ND (25 ยตL)** โ€” clean synthetic muguet, cosmetic character โ€” layered above for transparency.+- **Bourgeonal (10 ยตL)** โ€” aldehydic muguet, completes the muguet chord at low dose (powerful material).+- **DBCA (30 ยตL)** โ€” gardenia-rose cosmetic-clean white floral cushion; chosen over raw Jasmine FO (pre-blend, opaque, not precise) and Methyl Benzoate (wrong ester direction).+- **Freesia HDI (20 ยตL)** โ€” green-floral transparency; bridges iris's faint earthiness (Carrot Seed) into the white floral register without adding leafy green.+- **PEDMC (20 ยตL)** โ€” rose-magnolia soft-clean; chosen over PEA (too raw-rosy) for a dreamier magnolia facet.+- **Hedione (280 ยตL)** โ€” radiance amplifier and volume expander; the Diorella-engine that gives the white floral heart its diffusion and keeps the whole composition luminous. Without Hedione the iris + muguet + cream would sit heavy-flat on skin.+- **Hedione HC (40 ยตL)** โ€” high-cis Hedione for the jasmine-core facet; complements plain Hedione with a deeper rounded jasmine register.+- **Farnesol (2 ยตL)** โ€” trace lily-muguet fixative; IFRA-restricted, used at the lowest effective dose. Adds a subtle muguet-fixation that extends Hydroxycitronellal's volatile lifespan.++### CREAM / HELIOTROPIN / COUMARIN / VANILLIN / LACTONE โ€” 505 ยตL, 21.6 %+The luxury drydown register โ€” explicitly per user spec. All materials chosen to integrate into ONE creamy-vanillic-heliotropinic-powdery mass.++- **Heliotropal / Piperonal (50 ยตL)** โ€” THE heliotropin-powder-cream anchor. Sweet-almond-heliotrope-powdery. Chosen over Heliotropin Fleuressence (pre-blend, opaque). Heliotropal bridges iris powder (Musk Ketone + Alpha Irone) into vanillic-cream.+- **Coumarin 20 % (200 ยตL โ’ 40 ยตL active)** โ€” creamy-hay-tonka register. Neat powder Coumarin used via 20 % dilution for dosing precision.+- **Vanillin 10 % (120 ยตL โ’ 12 ยตL active)** โ€” vanilla cream body.+- **Ethyl Vanillin neat (5 ยตL)** โ€” trace amplifier (3ร— stronger than Vanillin); the whisper of Ethyl Vanillin deepens the vanilla register without pulling the formula into an overt gourmand.+- **Ethyl Maltol 10 % (40 ยตL โ’ 4 ยตL active)** โ€” kept LOW; just enough caramel-candy lift to add hedonic sweetness under the cream without making it "edible". This is explicitly a luxury creamy perfume, not a gourmand.+- **Anisaldehyde (8 ยตL)** โ€” sweet-powdery heliotrope echo; reinforces the heliotropin-powder axis at low dose.+- **Gamma Undecalactone (12 ยตL)** โ€” peach-dairy lactone; contributes the creamy-lactonic character the user specified.+- **Delta Decalactone (10 ยตL)** โ€” milk-coconut lactone; paired with Undecalactone for a full lactonic register (dairy + peach skin).+- **Benzoin 50 % DPG (60 ยตL โ’ 30 ยตL active)** โ€” balsamic-vanillic depth; deepens Vanillin's drydown and integrates it into the coumarinic hay register. Chosen over Siam Benzoin (50% too) for the cleaner balsamic profile.++### MUSK / FIXATIVE / STRUCTURAL COCOON โ€” 735 ยตL, 31.5 %+Multi-axis musk chord (depth + projection + character-echo) plus 2-layer salicylate diffusion.++- **Benzyl Salicylate (140 ยตL)** โ€” heavy cosmetic diffusion cushion; THE fixative bridge between white floral and cream. Chosen for its deep-waxy-cosmetic-warm character matching the luxury brief.+- **Hexyl Salicylate (60 ยตL)** โ€” lighter green-floral salicylate layered ABOVE Benzyl Sal; creates a gradient salicylate fixation (light over heavy) that maintains transparency.+- **Ethylene Brassylate (150 ยตL)** โ€” **PRIMARY musk, depth axis.** Chosen because EB is the ONLY musk in this inventory whose character (creamy, lactonic, slightly thick) directly REINFORCES the cream register. Habanolide was evaluated and rejected as primary โ€” its macrocyclic skin-warmth does not echo the cream. Galaxolide rejected โ€” synthetic-laundry clashes with luxury niche brief. Zenolide rejected โ€” citrus-fresh wrong register. EB + the lactones (Undecalactone + Decalactone) + Exaltolide form a single fused lactonic-creamy mass.+- **Exaltolide 10 % (80 ยตL โ’ 8 ยตL active)** โ€” depth axis, skin-fatty intimate; adds natural skin-oil quality that lets the formula read as "her skin, but more luxurious".+- **Ambrettolide 10 % DPG (60 ยตL โ’ 6 ยตL active)** โ€” **character-echo axis**, most naturalistic macrocyclic, fruity-musky-wine-like; adds quiet skin warmth and a naturalistic edge that counterweights the synthetic precision of EB.+- **Habanolide (70 ยตL)** โ€” RESTRAINED. Chosen as secondary intimate-skin musk; not the hero (cream needs lactonic EB, not plain macrocyclic). Adds intimate-trail under EB's projection.+- **Ebanol (55 ยตL)** โ€” creamy-sandalwood. Chosen over Javanol (too cold-dry-mineral for cream direction), Bacdanol (too heavy-traditional for dreamy register), Sandalore (too fresh-light, doesn't echo cream). Ebanol's milky-creamy character matches and extends the cream register. **Sandalwood register chosen: creamy-soft, not dry-intimate or round-heavy.**+- **Iso E Super (90 ยตL)** โ€” molecular skin-cocoon for skin adhesion and the "what are you wearing" halo effect. Kept moderate (not the 300โ€“500 ยตL overdose) because the formula has audible woody-creamy character (Ebanol + Benzoin + EB); Iso E's abstract-cedar is a SUPPORT not a structural pillar here.+- **Ambrox Super 30 % (30 ยตL โ’ 9 ยตL active)** โ€” TRACE only. Crystalline-mineral amber register chosen at minimal dose for subliminal depth. Ambermax was evaluated and rejected โ€” its warm-rounded amber would dominate and fight the cream (adds a *second* warmth that clashes with Benzoin + coumarin + vanillin). Ambrox at trace adds depth without adding character.++### SUB-ODT COMPLEXITY TRACES โ€” 29 ยตL, 1.2 %+These sit at or below odor detection threshold. They are not audible as discrete notes โ€” they enrich the hedonic, textural, and luminous character of the audible structure. Per user spec: "positive direction of scent".++- **Aurantiol (5 ยตL)** โ€” orange-blossom-powder Schiff base trace; reinforces the white-floral-powder bridge between muguet heart and cream base.+- **Damascol 10 % (15 ยตL โ’ 1.5 ยตL active)** โ€” rose-plum damascone; softer and more rounded than Alpha/Beta Damascone. Chosen specifically because the formula already has enough fruit character from Ambrettolide + Undecalactone โ€” Damascol's *rounded plum* reinforces hedonic softness without adding a fruity character note.+- **Geosmin 1 % TEC (3 ยตL โ’ 0.03 ยตL active)** โ€” petrichor / rain-on-earth trace at the absolute lower limit (max recommended 5 ยตL of 1 % per 100 mL; here 0.3 ยตL-equivalent per 10 mL). ODT โ 6 ppt โ€” sub-threshold. Adds the "dreamy" mineral-earth undertone the user asked for; overdose would destroy the composition (beet-soil), hence the extreme restraint.+- **Indole 10 % (3 ยตL โ’ 0.3 ยตL active)** โ€” trace indolic depth under the white florals; provides the "living" quality of white flowers without reading as urinous or animalic. Sub-ODT.+- **Isoeugenol (3 ยตL)** โ€” trace carnation-halo; bridges coumarin + vanillin + heliotropin into a spicy-balsamic unity. Sub-ODT; just enough to widen the drydown's hedonic register.++---++## Why This Reads as ONE Perfume (Single-Direction Synergy)++Every register pulls toward the same direction: **powder โ’ cream โ’ vanillic-coumarinic luxury**. The bridges are deliberate, overlapping, and redundant:++1. **Iris โ’ White Floral bridge:** Orivone (buttery iris) + Hedione + DBCA + Carrot Seed create a gradient; no gap.+2. **White Floral โ’ Cream bridge:** Hydroxycitronellal + Heliotropal + Farnesol + Anisaldehyde; the muguet-lily register contains intrinsic powder (Hydroxycitronellal) that prepares the nose for Heliotropal's almond-heliotrope-powder.+3. **Cream โ’ Powder closure:** Musk Ketone (powder axis musk) + Heliotropal + Coumarin + Vanillin + Ethylene Brassylate form a fused mass; they share character so the composition reads as ONE creamy-powdery cloud, not as "heart + base".+4. **Structural cocoon:** Benzyl Sal + Hexyl Sal + Ethylene Brassylate + Iso E Super + Ebanol create a continuous skin film that holds all three registers in mutual diffusion.+5. **Sub-ODT resonance:** Aurantiol + Damascol + Geosmin + Indole + Isoeugenol add subliminal hedonic depth at 5 different micro-axes (orange-flower powder, rose-plum, earth, indolic, carnation) that the nose perceives as "richness" without identifying them.++**Expected performance:** long-lasting (12โ€“16 hr projection, 24+ hr skin trail driven by EB + Exaltolide + Ambrettolide + Benzoin + Benzyl Sal macrocyclic/balsamic fixation); strong projective sillage first 4โ€“6 hr (Hedione + Hexyl Sal diffusion + Romandolide-class projection from EB); textured drydown (cream + lactone + powder + balsamic layering).++---++## Mixing Order (recommended)++1. Weigh solid Coumarin into Coumarin 20 % dilution bottle first (prepare separately if not already done).+2. Add neat powerhouses first (Hedione, Benzyl Salicylate, Ethylene Brassylate, Iso E Super, Habanolide) into a clean 10 mL amber bottle.+3. Add dilutions next (Alpha Irone 30 %, Musk Ketone 10 %, Coumarin 20 %, Vanillin 10 %, Exaltolide 10 %, Ambrettolide 10 %, Ambrox Super 30 %, Ethyl Maltol 10 %, Scentenal 1 %, Damascol 10 %, Indole 10 %, Geosmin 1 %).+4. Add remaining neat materials (ionones, floral materials, heliotropal, lactones, musks, citrus).+5. Add traces last (Farnesol, Aurantiol, Ethyl Vanillin, Isoeugenol) using a clean micropipette.+6. Add 7.67 mL ethanol 96 %. Cap, shake 30 s, rest.+7. **Maceration: 4โ€“6 weeks minimum.** Coumarin + Vanillin + Heliotropal + Benzoin + Musk Ketone all require extended maceration for full integration โ€” this is not a formula to evaluate at 48 hr.++---++## Rejected Alternatives โ€” Design Record++| Reflex pick | Rejected because | Used instead |+|---|---|---|+| Javanol (sandalwood) | Cold-dry-mineral clashes with cream direction | Ebanol (milky-creamy matches) |+| Habanolide (musk default) | No lactonic echo to cream; no powder echo to iris | EB primary (lactonic depth) + Musk Ketone (powder echo) |+| Ambermax / Ambrofix | Warm-rounded amber fights Benzoin + vanillin (double warmth) | Ambrox Super trace (crystalline depth only) |+| Galaxolide | Laundry-synthetic breaks luxury niche character | Ethylene Brassylate (lactonic creamy) |+| Bergamot FCF plain | Too light-cologne, no dreamy weight | Bergamot FCF Sicilian (richer at lower dose) |+| Jasmine FO | Pre-blend opaque โ€” can't tune | Hedione + Hedione HC + Indole 10 % trace + DBCA (controllable jasmine facet) |+| Heliotropin Fleuressence | Pre-blend opaque | Heliotropal (precise Piperonal) + Anisaldehyde echo |+| High-dose AIMI | User spec: low AIMI only | AIMI 40 ยตL (modest), Alpha Irone + Alpha Ionone carry the iris |+| Oakmoss / Evernyl | Breaks single-direction synergy into chypre | Omitted entirely |+| Patchouli EO | Adds earthy-camphor facet, wrong direction | Omitted |+| Leather / Styrax / IBQ | Smoky-animalic breaks dreamy powder | Omitted |++---++**Summary:** 45 materials, 23.3 % concentrate, 10 mL batch. Iris orris powder hero + hydroxycitronellal muguet white floral heart + coumarin-vanillin-heliotropin-lactone creamy drydown, fused by multi-axis musk chord (EB depth / Habanolide intimacy / Ambrettolide naturalism / Musk Ketone powder-echo) and 2-layer salicylate diffusion. Sub-ODT traces (Geosmin + Indole + Damascol + Aurantiol + Isoeugenol) add hedonic texture beneath the audible structure. Single-direction synergy: powdery-creamy-vanillic-heliotropinic luxury.diff --git a/formulas/collections/Iris_Reverie_Lactee_50mL_optimized.md b/formulas/collections/Iris_Reverie_Lactee_50mL_optimized.mdnew file mode 100644index 0000000..9a0ce70--- /dev/null+++ b/formulas/collections/Iris_Reverie_Lactee_50mL_optimized.md@@ -0,0 +1,873 @@+# Iris Rรชverie Lactรฉe โ€” 50 mL โ€” Version Selector++> โ ๏ธ **Brief-alignment notice (2026-04-23):** The scoring engine's composite geo+> is **not a brief-alignment metric**. After perfumer review, the optimizer-winning+> **v6** was diagnosed as **off-brief**: it won composite by pushing Carrot Seed+> EO to 800 ยตL (5.4 % of concentrate โ€” dominant rooty-earth character) and+> dumping Benzyl Salicylate (the cosmetic-cushion spine of the brief). That's+> the *Iris Silver Mist / No. 19* axis (rooty-earth naturalism), not the+> **Prada Infusion d'Iris / L'Heure Bleue** axis the brief asks for+> (cosmetic-creamy-powder white floral).+>+> **โ“ RECOMMENDED: v7a** โ€” v7 with **Cedarwood Virginia EO โ’ Cedarwood EO** swap.+> Virginia reads "pencil-shaving / smoky" against a cosmetic-creamy-iris brief;+> generic Cedarwood EO is the neutral natural-cedar register the brief wants.+> The swap yields **geo 80.810 (+2.02 vs v3, +2.77 vs v7)** with hedonic held+> at **85.70 (+1.00 vs v3)** โ€” the only version that beats v3 on composite+> AND hedonic simultaneously. Engine note: Cedarwood Virginia is missing from+> the diffusion model's VP table, so part of the sillage lift (+23.5) is+> engine artefact โ€” but the character direction is perfumer-correct.+>+> **Alternatives:**+> - **v3** โ€” canonical brief-balanced baseline. A constrained hill-climb (v8)+>   from v3 with brief caps found only Ebanol +50 ยตL. **v3 is near-optimal+>   inside the brief** with Virginia cedar.+> - **v7** โ€” pre-swap perfumer version (still uses Virginia). Kept for reference.+>+> **Wear v6 only if the brief shifts to "naturalistic rooty iris."**+>+> | Version | geo | ฮ” vs v3 | hedonic | sillage | luxury | character |+> |---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|+> | v3 baseline | 78.790 | โ€” | 84.70 | 74.50 | 63.40 | canonical, Virginia cedar |+> | **v6** (scorer pick) | **79.025** | **+0.235** | 84.20 | 74.60 | **64.30** | โ ๏ธ off-brief rooty-earth |+> | **v7** (perfumer, Virginia) | 78.013 | โ’0.777 | **85.90** | 74.90 | 61.10 | โ“ on-brief, smoky cedar |+> | **v7a** (perfumer, natural cedar) | **80.810** | **+2.008** | 85.70 | **98.40** | 61.00 | โ“โ“ **best composite โ€” neutral cedar** |+> | **v7b** (brief-push, 2026-04-23) | 80.542 | +1.254 | 85.60 | 100.00 | 58.70 | โ“โ“ **best brief-fit** โ€” amber split + buttery + powder + white-floral push |+> | v8 (brief-constrained) | 78.813 | +0.023 | 84.80 | 74.60 | 63.40 | v3 + Ebanol 50 |+>+> **v7b vs v7a trade-off:** v7b is character-correct for the **refined brief**+> ("powdery iris white floral powder creamy") โ€” splits the amber (Ambrox 300 ++> Ambermax 250 + Azarbre 100), lifts the butter (Orivone 650 + Delta Deca 500 ++> Gamma Deca 100), thickens the powder (Musk Ketone 900 + Heliotropal 150 ++> Anisaldehyde 100 + Helional 50), amplifies the cosmetic cushion (Benzyl Sal+> 500 + Hexyl Sal 500), and adds white-floral body (DBCA 125, Lilyreal 125,+> ACA 40). Composite falls โ’0.39 vs v7a because the extra mass dilutes luxury+> (โ’2.3) and perceptual_clarity (โ’3.2). Stacking_depth gains +5 (better layering).+> Hedonic holds at 85.60. **Wear v7b if the brief emphasis is on powder-+> plush-cosmetic; wear v7a if maximum composite score / minimum material count+> matters more.**+>+> **Takeaway:** when the scorer's composite disagrees with perfumer intuition,+> check which *axis* it's rewarding. Here v6 wins on **luxury/photorealism**+> (naturalistic EO density), v7 wins on **hedonic** (brief-fit pleasantness).+> See [_opt_v7_v8_iris_brief.py](../../_opt_v7_v8_iris_brief.py),+> [_opt_v7_v8_iris_brief.json](../../_opt_v7_v8_iris_brief.json),+> [_opt_v7_v8_out.txt](../../_opt_v7_v8_out.txt).++---++# Iris Rรชverie Lactรฉe โ€” 50 mL v7a (perfumer-hand, natural-cedar swap) โ€” **RECOMMENDED FOR BRIEF**++**Batch:** 50.00 mL ยท **Concentrate โ 14.72 mL (29.43 %)** ยท **Ethanol 96 %:** โ 35.28 mL++**v7a geo:** 80.810 (ฮ” vs v3 +2.008, ฮ” vs v7 +2.774) ยท **hedonic 85.70 (+1.00 vs v3)** ยท **sillage 98.40 (+23.9 vs v3)**++### Single change vs v7++| Ingredient | v7 | v7a | ฮ” | Why |+|---|---|---|---:|---|+| **Cedarwood Virginia EO** โ’ **Cedarwood EO** | 300 ยตL | 300 ยตL (same volume, different material) | โ€” | Virginia reads **"pencil-shaving / smoky / angular cedar"** (engine: `char: "pencil-shaving cedar"`). Generic Cedarwood EO reads **"natural cedar"** (engine: `char: "natural cedar"`) โ€” neutral, less assertive, cleaner against a cosmetic-creamy iris core. The smoky facet of Virginia reads as **masculine aromatic intrusion** into a powder-iris composition; neutral cedar supports the wood-cream register without flagging itself. |++### Why this single swap moves the score so much (+2.77 vs v7)++Two mechanisms:++1. **Character-correct for brief** (legitimate): neutral cedar recedes into the wood-cream register (Ebanol 1100 + Javanol 100 + Iso E Super 200), letting Orivone / Delta Decalactone / Alpha Irone drive the iris-butter face without a smoky counterweight.+2. **Engine artefact** (partially): `Cedarwood Virginia EO` is **missing from `engine/diffusion_model.py`**'s VP table โ€” the engine falls back to a default volatility for it, under-scoring its sillage contribution. `Cedarwood EO` has `VP_25 = 0.25` explicit. The +23.5 sillage jump is inflated by this data gap (real-world difference would be smaller but still favours generic Cedarwood EO for diffusion). **Flagge