hat "fougรจre" means.++---++## Batch Parameters++| Parameter | Value |+|---|---|+| Total batch | 30 mL |+| EDP concentration | ~20 % (see note on concentrate volume below) |+| Fragrance concentrate | ~6.8 mL (see stock note) |+| Ethanol 96% (bottle fill) | ~23.2 mL |+| Drop reference | 20 ยตL / drop |++> **Stock volume note:** Ambrox Super (30%) and Vanillin (10%) are stock solutions.+> Their added solvent volume expands the concentrate to ~6.8 mL instead of 6.0 mL.+> Compensate by filling the bottle with ~23.2 mL ethanol (not 24.0 mL).+> Total fragrance loading in the finished EDP is unchanged.++---++## Formula (wt% of neat fragrance, from optimiser)++| # | Material | wt% | Neat ยตL |+|--:|---|---:|---:|+| 1 | Hedione | 16.92 | 1015 |+| 2 | Iso E Super | 13.62 | 817 |+| 3 | Habanolide | 9.05 | 543 |+| 4 | Lavender EO | 8.10 | 486 |+| 5 | Galaxolide | 7.04 | 422 |+| 6 | Cedarwood EO | 6.89 | 413 |+| 7 | Bergamot FCF | 6.25 | 375 |+| 8 | Linalyl Acetate | 5.73 | 344 |+| 9 | Coumarin | 5.32 | 319 mg (weigh) |+| 10 | Patchouli EO | 5.18 | 311 |+| 11 | Vetiver EO | 3.44 | 206 |+| 12 | Geraniol | 3.34 | 200 |+| 13 | Evernyl | 2.31 | 139 |+| 14 | Ambrox Super | 2.28 | 137 neat |+| 15 | Hexyl Salicylate | 2.10 | 126 |+| 16 | Eugenol | 1.48 | 89 |+| 17 | Vanillin | 0.94 | 56 neat |+| โ€” | **Total** | **100.00** | **~6000 ยตL neat** |++---++## Mixing Order โ€” Base to Top++Add to a clean 10 mL vial in this order. Swirl between each addition for heavy materials.++| Step | Material | Stock | Measure | Notes |+|---:|---|---|---:|---|+| 1 | Habanolide | neat | **543 ยตL** | Heaviest musk โ€” add first |+| 2 | Galaxolide | 100% | **422 ยตL** | Musk anchor |+| 3 | Ambrox Super | 30% | **457 ยตL** | = 137 ยตL neat amber fixative |+| 4 | Vanillin | 10% | **564 ยตL** | = 56 ยตL neat; sweet base anchor |+| 5 | Coumarin | neat powder | **319 mg** | Weigh on 0.001 g scale; swirl into warm liquid until dissolved โ€” this is the fougรจre signature |+| 6 | Hexyl Salicylate | neat | **126 