e at 7.5 ยตL active speaks as rooty-butter orris, not "violet perfume." Orivone fills the butter register. Allyl Ionone adds green-woody concrete edge.++**Drydown (2โ€“6 hours):** Musk bloom timeline: Romandolide at 30 min (clean woody projection), EB at 90 min (creamy depth), Musk Ketone at 120 min (powder-echo iris). Kephalis woody-amber-tobacco at 3,333 OAV provides the Amouage character without harshness. Patchouli dark earth grounds everything. Benzoin sweet-balsamic warmth emerges late. Benzyl Benzoate invisible anchor extends all naturals 2-3 hours.++**6+ hours:** Musk Ketone powder-echo iris + Vertofix woody-musky bridge + Benzoin + Javanol intimate sandalwood skin. Cardamom memory faded. No smoke. No animalics. No harshness. Just beautiful, elegant, complex warmth.++---++## HOW IT READS++This is what happens when maximalist complexity meets minimalist restraint. The Amouage brought the architecture โ€” the musk bloom timeline, the Paradisamide ghost amplifier, the incense-resin DNA, the dry woods symphony. The Henry Jacques brought the wisdom โ€” drop everything that challenges wearability, let the Alpha Irone speak without violet competition, add Cardamom for brightness, anchor everything with BB for 8+ hour longevity.++**It's not a compromise. It's the best of both.**++---++*Collaboration formula. Amouage complexity without confrontation. Henry Jacques elegance without simplicity. 45 materials. 30 mL @ 29.4% EdP. Total OAV 68,606. All values verified against engine/odor_thresholds.py.*diff --git "a/formulas/complete/Lavande_S\303\250che_2026-05-10.md" "b/formulas/complete/Lavande_S\303\250che_2026-05-10.md"new file mode 100644index 0000000..8810ff9--- /dev/null+++ "b/formulas/complete/Lavande_S\303\250che_2026-05-10.md"@@ -0,0 +1,205 @@+# Lavande Sรจche โ€” Woody-Lavender โ€” 10 mL Eau de Parfum++**Batch:** 10.00 mL ยท ~19.8% EdP ยท 25 materials+**Profile:** High-altitude French lavender over dry sandalwood, rooty vetiver, mossy-mineral base. No citrus. No sweetness. No amber. Structured, close-wearing, serious.+**Maceration:** 4 weeks minimum++---++## Equipment++- 1 amber glass bottle 15 mL+- 1 graduated pipette 1 mL (for 100โ€“400 ยตL)+- 1 micro-pipette or 1 mL syringe graduated 0.01 mL (for 5โ€“80 ยตL)+- Ethanol 96% (perfumer's grade)++---++## Procedure โ€” Layer A: Base (heaviest first)++Pipette directly into bottle. Wipe or swap pipette between materials.++| # | Material | Dilution | ยตL | Active ยตL | Role |+|--:|----------|----------|----:|----------:|------|+| 1 | Iso E Super | neat | 220 | 220.0 | molecular cocoon โ€” skin-adhesion architecture |+| 2 | Romandolide | neat | 200 | 200.0 | clean macrocyclic projection musk |+| 3 | Vertofix | neat | 60 | 60.0 | woody-musk structural bridge |+| 4 | Evernyl | neat | 55 | 55.0 | mossy-mineral structure โ€” character anchor |+| 5 | Clearwood | neat | 50 | 50.0 | carbon-mineral earth โ€” modern |+| 6 | Patchouli EO | neat | 25 | 25.0 | camphor-earth anchor |+| 7 | Norlimbanol Dextro | neat | 10 | 10.0 | extreme woody tenacity โ€” structural pillar |+| 8 | Kephalis | neat | 10 | 10.0 | woody-amber-tobacco industrial structure |+| 9 | Nagarmortha Oil | neat | 6 | 6.0 | cypriol dry-smoky depth โ€” oud bridge |++**Base subtotal: ~636 ยตL** โ€” swirl gently 5 seconds.++---++## Procedure โ€” Layer B: Heart++| # | Material | Dilution | ยตL | Active ยตL | Role |+|--:|----------|----------|----:|----------:|------|+| 10 | Hedione | neat | 250 | 250.0 | radiance amplifier โ€” transparency without drowning lavender |+| 11 | Javanol | neat | 90 | 90.0 | dry-mineral sandalwood precision โ€” architectural |+| 12 | Geraniol | neat | 60 | 60.0 | geranium-leaf green-rose bridge |+| 13 | Clary Sage EO | neat | 40 | 40.0 | amber-tobacco herbal depth |+| 14 | Vetiver EO (India) | neat | 35 | 35.0 | rooty earth โ€” Indian ruh khus |+| 15 | Dihydrojasmone | neat | 18 | 18.0 | creamy jasmine ketone โ€” radiance realism |+| 16 | Ambrettolide | 10% in DPG | 160 | 16.0 | whispered natural sk