tion | ยตL |+|--:|----------|----------|----:|+| 10 | Hedione | neat | 250 |+| 11 | Javanol | neat | 90 |+| 12 | Geraniol | neat | 60 |+| 13 | Clary Sage EO | neat | 40 |+| 14 | Vetiver EO (India) | neat | 35 |+| 15 | Dihydrojasmone | neat | 18 |+| 16 | Ambrettolide | 10% in DPG | 160 |+| 17 | Damascenone | 1% | 4 |+| 18 | Alpha Damascone | 10% in DPG | 4 |++### Base (9)+| # | Material | Dilution | ยตL |+|--:|----------|----------|----:|+| 1 | Iso E Super | neat | 220 |+| 2 | Romandolide | neat | 200 |+| 3 | Vertofix | neat | 60 |+| 4 | Evernyl | neat | 55 |+| 5 | Clearwood | neat | 50 |+| 6 | Patchouli EO | neat | 25 |+| 7 | Norlimbanol Dextro | neat | 10 |+| 8 | Kephalis | neat | 10 |+| 9 | Nagarmortha Oil | neat | 6 |++**Total concentrate:** 1,979 ยตL (19.8%)+**Ethanol 96%:** 8,021 ยตL+**Total bottle:** 10,000 ยตL++---++## Accord Architecture++**Top โ€” dark-aromatic, no citrus:** High-altitude lavender's full spectrum opens first โ€” the floral linalyl acetate sweetness, then the herbaceous-camphor edge. Black pepper adds dry spark. Cedarwood Virginia provides pencil-shaving warmth as the structural backbone. No citrus lift โ€” instead, rosemary and juniper berry supply coniferous-herbal freshness, while spike lavender reinforces the camphor facet. This opening says "lavender" unambiguously, but a darker, more serious lavender than any fougรจre.++**Heart โ€” dry sandalwood, rooty earth:** Javanol's dry-mineral sandalwood precision meets the lavender's persistent herbaceous core. Geraniol bridges with geranium-leaf green-rose brightness โ€” the only softness in the composition. Clary sage adds amber-tobacco herbal depth without sweetness. Vetiver India draws rooty earth through the middle register. Dihydrojasmone provides creamy jasmine radiance at trace. Damascenone and Alpha Damascone whisper rose-narcotic luxury โ€” felt as texture, not identified as a note.++**Base โ€” mossy-mineral, no amber:** Evernyl anchors the drydown with mossy-mineral structure โ€” the