ture of the modern blue genre (Sauvage, BdC). Its absence is what separates this formula from that axis. Adding even 50 ยตL of DHM would pull the top toward "shower gel" and undermine the dark-aromatic character.++### Lavender proportion+At 400 ยตL, lavender represents 20.2% of the concentrate โ€” the single largest material. In Bleu Carbon, lavender HA is 6.7% of concentrate (340/5044). This formula gives lavender nearly 3ร— the proportional weight. Combined with Linalyl Acetate and Spike Lavender, the lavender complex is 473 ยตL (23.9% of concentrate) โ€” the formula IS lavender.++## Allergen Declarations (EU 26)++Geraniol, Linalool (from Lavender EO, Linalyl Acetate, Clary Sage, Spike Lavender, Rosemary)++---++## Headspace OAV โ€” Full 24-Material Ranking (vapor above skin, 32ยฐC)++OAV = vapor ppm / ODT air ppb (VP ร— ppm heuristic, same method as Bleu Carbon recalc).+Values < 1 are subliminal โ€” felt as texture/density, not smelled.+Rosemary EO excluded (no VP data in ingredient intelligence model).++| # | Material | Active ยตL | ppm fin | OAV | Band | Primarily serves |+|--:|----------|----------:|--------:|------:|------|:-----------------|+| 1 | Vertofix | 60.0 | 6,000 | **2,340.0** | dominant | Woody-musk structural bridge |+| 2 | Romandolide | 200.0 | 20,000 | **2,000.0** | dominant | Clean macrocyclic projection musk |+| 3 | Linalyl Acetate | 55.0 | 5,500 | **1,925.0** | dominant | Lavender facet amplifier โ€” top note |+| 4 | Damascenone | 0.04 | 4 | **1,386.0** | dominant | Rose-narcotic whisper |+| 5 | Clary Sage EO | 40.0 | 4,000 | **1,333.3** | dominant | Herbal-aromatic depth |+| 6 | Alpha Damascone | 0.4 | 40 | **1,110.0** | dominant | Metallic rose luxury |+| 7 | **Lavender EO High Altitude** | **400.0** | **40,000** | **1,000.0** | dominant | **THE star โ€” aromatic-fougere soul** |+| 8 | Kephalis | 10.0 | 1,000 | 920.0 | dominant | Woody-amber-tobacco structure |+| 9 | Black Pepper EO | 35.0 | 3,500 | 525.0 | dominant | Dry pepper spark |+| 10 |