ch at ANY volume+python _dhc_a_lemon_universal.py 25 0    # 25 mL fresh+python _dhc_a_lemon_universal.py 47 0    # 47 mL fresh+python _dhc_a_lemon_universal.py 100 0   # 100 mL fresh++# Correction from your existing 30 mL to ANY volume+python _dhc_a_lemon_universal.py 40 30   # -> 40 mL+python _dhc_a_lemon_universal.py 50 30   # -> 50 mL+python _dhc_a_lemon_universal.py 75 30   # -> 75 mL+python _dhc_a_lemon_universal.py 100 30  # -> 100 mL+```++The script calculates exact ยตL for every material automatically.++---++## Summary++| Your Question | Answer |+|--------------|--------|+| Any volume? | **Yes.** Just multiply % by `0.12 ร— V ร— 1000` |+| Same concentration? | **Yes.** Always 12% v/v |+| Same smell? | **Yes.** Identical ratios |+| With existing batch? | **Yes.** Subtract what you have, add the rest |++**The formula is a percentage law. It doesn't care about milliliters.**diff --git a/formulas/demachy_redux/DHC_A_BottleA_Lemon_Extension.md b/formulas/demachy_redux/DHC_A_BottleA_Lemon_Extension.mdnew file mode 100644index 0000000..fd93ec9--- /dev/null+++ b/formulas/demachy_redux/DHC_A_BottleA_Lemon_Extension.md@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@+# DHC A Bottle A โ€” Lemon Extension Additions++**Date:** 2026-05-13+**Base:** DHC A Bottle A (Realistic Lemon Tree), 50 mL+**Goal:** Extend lemon phase from ~15 min to ~1.5 hr without changing perfume identity++## Pre-preparation (24โ€“48 hr ahead)++| Step | What | Instructions |+|:----:|------|-------------|+| A | **Lemonile 1% in DPG** | 0.1 g Lemonile + 9.9 g DPG in a vial. Label. |+| B | **Citral + MA Schiff base** | 100 ยตL Citral + 100 ยตL Methyl Anthranilate in a separate vial. Cap. Wait 24โ€“48 hr. Optionally add a few granules of anhydrous MgSOโ. |++## Addition List (add to existing 50 mL bottle in order)++| # | Material | ยตL | Active ยตL | Role |+|--:|----------|:--:|:---------:|------|+| 1 | Benzyl Salicylate | 20 | 20 | Micro-anchor ยท VP 0.01 Pa |+| 2 | Hexyl Salicylate | 150 | 150 | Fixative film ยท VP 0.077 Pa |+| 3 | 