@ -0,0 +1,105 @@+# DHC Veritas vs. Real Dior Homme Cologne (2026 Counter) โ€” Cross-Check++## What DHC Actually Smells Like Today++**Opening:** Synthetic bergamot blast โ€” bright, slightly candied, metallic-clean. Less "Calabrian peel" than early batches.++**Heart:** Clean, soapy **iris** (not the lipstick-violet iris of Dior Homme 2005). Stripped-down, laundry-fresh white iris. Trace neroli/orange blossom โ€” subtle.++**Drydown:** Clean musk + ambroxan. Skin-scent territory within 3โ€“4 hours. **No woods. No depth. No darkness.** Deliberately hollow in the base.++**Overall:** "Shower fresh" citrus-musk. Safe, mass-pleasing, office-friendly.++---++## Our DHC Veritas I (Bergamot) โ€” Headspace Reality++| Rank | Material | OAV | %Share | Role |+|------|----------|-----|--------|------|+| 1 | Hedione | 53,400 | 28.9% | Radiance |+| 2 | Bergamot FCF Sicilian | 52,500 | 28.4% | Star Citrus |+| 3 | Iso E Super | 44,352 | 24.0% | Woody Structure |+| 4 | Petitgrain EO | 10,500 | 5.7% | Green-Bitter Lift |+| 5 | Hedione HC | 6,408 | 3.5% | Radiance Nuance |+| 6 | Dihydrojasmone | 6,136 | 3.3% | Jasmine Flower |+| 7 | Javanol | 6,000 | 3.2% | Sandalwood |+| 8 | Vetival | 2,612 | 1.4% | Vetiver-Suede |++**Concentration:** ~17% | **Materials:** 16 | **Citrus mass:** 50% of active++---++## Critical Divergences++### 1. Iris โ€” COMPLETELY MISSING+- **Real DHC:** Clean soapy iris is the heart signature. Not powdery, not violet โ€” laundry-fresh white iris.+- **Our formula:** Zero iris material. No orris, no ionone, no Alpha Irone, no Molecule Iris.+- **Impact:** Our formula reads as "citrus-jasmine-woods." DHC reads as "citrus-iris-musk." Different family entirely.++### 2. Base Architecture โ€” OPPOSITE PHILOSOPHY+- **Real DHC:** Hollow base. Musk + ambroxan only. Skin-scent at 3โ€“4 hours. **Subtraction aesthetic.**+- **Our formula:** Dense wood fortress. Iso E Super (24% OAV) + Norlimbanol + Vetival + Javanol + Cardamom. **Addition aesthetic.**+- **Impact:** Our formula lasts 8โ€“10 hours. DHC dies at 4โ€“6. Our base is thick and warm; DHC's is thin and clean.++### 3. Musk Class โ€” WRONG MUSK FAMILY+- **Real DHC:** Clean white musk (likely Galaxolide-type or Habanolide-type polycyclic) + ambroxan.+- **Our formula:** Romandolide (clean woody-musk) + Ethylene Brassylate (creamy lactonic) + Ambrofix (amber).+- **Impact:** DHC smells like "fresh linen." Ours smells like "warm skin with wood."++### 4. Flower Accord โ€” WRONG FAMILY+- **Real DHC:** Iris heart + trace neroli/orange blossom.+- **Our formula:** Aurantiol (orange blossom Schiff base) + Dihydrojasmone (jasmine fruity-green).+- **Impact:** DHC is floral-soapy. Ours is floral-fruity-jasmine. Orange blossom โ  iris.++### 5. Complexity โ€” TOO MANY MATERIALS+- **Real DHC:** Reportedly 8โ€“12 materials. Deliberately linear.+- **Our formula:** 16 materials with 8 in the drydown alone.+- **Impact:** DHC doesn't "develop" โ€” it stays shower-fresh. Our formula evolves through woody-amber phases.++### 6. Petitgrain โ€” TOO PROMINENT+- **Real DHC:** No detectable petitgrain. The green note is from synthetic bergamot boosters, not natural petitgrain.+- **Our formula:** 350ยตL Petitgrain EO (5.7% OAV). Adds green-bitter complexity DHC doesn't have.++### 7. Hedione Load โ€” TOO HIGH+- **Real DHC:** Uses hedione for radiance but not as the dominant headspace note.+- **Our formula:** Hedione is #1 at 28.9% OAV, beating bergamot. DHC's bergamot should dominate the opening.++---++## What Our Formula Actually Is++**Not Dior Homme Cologne.** It's a **citrus-woody-floral** in the style of:+- **Bergamote 22** (Le Labo) โ€” petitgrain + bergamot + woods+- **Neroli Portofino** (Tom Ford) โ€” massive citrus + white florals + ambroxan+- **Eau de Bergamote** (The Different Company) โ€” neroli/bergamot with vetiver++Our formula is **better** than current DHC in terms of complexity and naturalism. But it's **not a flanker of DHC** โ€” it's a different perfume entirely.++---++## Two Paths Forward++### Path A: Fix Veritas to Match Real DHC+- Replace flower accord with **iris** (Alpha Irone or Molecule Iris at trace)+- Strip drydown to **musk + ambroxan only** (remove Iso E Super, Norlimbanol, Vetival, Javanol, Cardamom)+- Add **white musk** (Galaxolide or Habanolide)+- Reduce hedione to let bergamot dominate opening+- Remove or drastically reduce petitgrain+- Target: 8โ€“10 materials, linear, 4โ€“6 hour longevity++### Path B: Keep Veritas as "Artisanal DHC" โ€” Better Than the Original+- Acknowledge our formula is **not a flanker** of commercial DHC+- Position it as "what DHC would be if Demachy had our materials and no cost constraints"+- Add iris anyway (because it makes it smell better)+- Keep the woody base but lighten it+- Market as "DHC DNA rebuilt with naturalism and depth"++---++## Recommendation++**Split the collection:**+- **DHC Vรฉritรฉ** (Truth) โ€” 7 formulas that match real DHC architecture: iris, clean musk, hollow base. True flankers.+- **DHC Veritas** (Our current) โ€” 7 formulas as "artisanal idealizations" โ€” what DHC should smell like. Richer, more complex, longer-lasting.++The user asked us to make the DHCs smell **better.** Path B delivers that. But if the goal is **true flankers**, we need Path A.diff --git a/formulas/demachy_redux/DHC_III_Grapefruit_50mL_EdP_Optimized_TomFord.md b/formulas/demachy_redux/DHC_III_Grapefruit_50mL_EdP_Optimized_TomFord.mdnew file mode 100644index 0000000..ebe3f7a--- /dev/null+++ b/formulas/demachy_redux/DHC_III_Grapefruit_50mL_EdP_Optimized_TomFord.md@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@+# DHC III โ€” Grapefruit Puriste (50mL EdP)++**House/Perfumer:** Tom Ford / Rodrigo Flores-Roux+**Hedione split:** 1200ยตL H + 500ยตL HC (29% high-cis)+**Compositional Score:** 9.5/10++## Batch Data+- 50 mL EdP | 10,171ยตL raw / 10,135ยตL active | ~20% conc | 17 materials | Ethanol ~40mL++## Formula++| # | Role | Material | Dilution | Raw ยตL | Active ยตL |+|---:|------|----------|----------|-------:|----------:|+|  1 | PETITGRAIN | Petitgrain EO | neat 