 0.208 |\n| 13 | Ambrox Super | 30% | 174 | 0.174 |\n| 14 | Vetiver EO | neat | 174 | 0.174 |\n| 15 | Galaxolide | 80% | 160 | 0.160 |\n| 16 | Dihydromyrcenol | neat | 147 | 0.147 |\n| 17 | Cedrat FCF oil Sicilian | neat | 132 | 0.132 |\n| 18 | Grapefruit FCF | neat | 117 | 0.117 |\n| 19 | Patchouli EO | neat | 104 | 0.104 |\n| 20 | Geraniol | neat | 100 | 0.100 |\n| 21 | Linalool | neat | 88 | 0.088 |\n| 22 | Evernyl | neat | 83 | 0.083 |\n| - | Concentrate rounding adjustment | - | -1 | -0.001 |\n| - | **Fragrance concentrate subtotal** | - | **6000** | **6.000** |\n| - | Ethanol 96% bottle fill | neat | **24000** | **24.000** |\n| - | **Final bottle total** | - | **30000** | **30.000** |\n\n### Family OAV Envelope\n\n| Window | Optimized family OAV |\n|---|---|\n| top | `citrus`=1851.7, `fresh`=784.8, `aromatic`=201.1, `radiance`=5.3, `wood`=3.9, `geranium`=3.2, `amber`=1.8, `musk`=1.8 |\n| heart | `fresh`=3735.3, `aromatic`=913.7, `citrus`=813.1, `radiance`=41.3, `wood`=30.8, `geranium`=22.6, `amber`=14.3, `musk`=14.2 |\n| base | `radiance`=46.0, `aromatic`=43.1, `wood`=39.1, `musk`=18.8, `amber`=18.7, `moss`=10.6, `cushion`=10.6, `geranium`=6.9 |\n\n### Vapor ppm / ODT / OAV Leaders\n\n**top window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Grapefruit FCF | 7.205081 | 0.005000 | 1441.0 |\n| Dihydromyrcenol | 0.784814 | 0.001000 | 784.8 |\n| Bergamot FCF | 4.290402 | 0.015000 | 286.0 |\n| Cedrat FCF oil Sicilian | 1.495354 | 0.012000 | 124.6 |\n| Linalool | 0.597643 | 0.006000 | 99.6 |\n| Lavender EO | 1.496446 | 0.020000 | 74.8 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 0.260985 | 0.015000 | 17.4 |\n| Linalyl Acetate | 0.434975 | 0.050000 | 8.7 |\n\n**heart window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Dihydromyrcenol | 3.735305 | 0.001000 | 3735.3 |\n| Bergamot FCF | 7.827661 | 0.015000 | 521.8 |\n| Linalool | 2.448103 | 0.006000 | 408.0 |\n| Lavender EO | 6.421315 | 0.020000 | 321.1 |\n| Cedrat FCF oil Sicilian | 3.494750 | 0.012000 | 291.2 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 1.801809 | 0.015000 | 120.1 |\n| Linalyl Acetate | 3.003015 | 0.050000 | 60.1 |\n| Hedione | 0.826465 | 0.020000 | 41.3 |\n\n**base window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Hedione | 0.920486 | 0.020000 | 46.0 |\n| Iso E Super | 0.261505 | 0.010000 | 26.2 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 0.372783 | 0.015000 | 24.9 |\n| Ambrox Super | 0.005624 | 0.000300 | 18.7 |\n| Habanolide | 0.018018 | 0.001000 | 18.0 |\n| Linalyl Acetate | 0.621305 | 0.050000 | 12.4 |\n| Evernyl | 0.021232 | 0.002000 | 10.6 |\n| Hexyl Salicylate | 0.031836 | 0.003000 | 10.6 |\n\n### Mixing Order\n\n1. Add musks, woods, moss, coumarin, and low-volatility materials first.\n2. Add Hedione/radiance and geranium-floral materials.\n3. Add lavender, clary, linalool/linalyl materials.\n4. Add citrus, fresh, marine, and trace high-impact materials last.\n5. Add ethanol bottle fill after the concentrate is homogeneous.\n6. Rest 48 hours before first read; judge seriously after 14 days.\n\n"+  },+  "scores": {+    "longevity": 77.6,+    "sillage": 98.2,+    "synergy": 95,+    "luxury": 51.5,+    "texture": 81,+    "stacking_depth": 69.0,+    "skin_performance": 75.1,+    "hedonic": 84.3,+    "perceptual_clarity": 82.0,+    "photorealism": 90.5,+    "arithmetic_total": 79.5,+    "geometric_total": 78.3,+    "_radar": {+      "warmth": 1.28,+      "sweetness": 0.97,+      "freshness": 3.96,+      "powdery": 0.56,+      "green": 1.38,+      "animalic": 0.19,+      "radiance": 3.41,+      "woody": 2.44,+      "spicy": 0.15,+      "floral": 2.27,+      "smoky": 0.18,+      "creamy": 0.47,+      "transparency": 6.51+    },+    "_style_fingerprint": {+      "dominant_style": "fougere",+      "primary_candidate": {+        "style": "fresh",+        "kind": "category",+        "score": 96.0,+        "confidence": 0.75,+        "signals": {+          "matched_keywords": [+            "bergamot"+          ],+          "matched_anchors": [+            "