%)\n           Heart note \u2014 forms the core character.\n  Step 17. Add Calone (1.92%)\n           Heart note \u2014 forms the core character.\n  Step 18. Add Phenethyl Alcohol (0.72%)\n           Heart note \u2014 forms the core character.\n  \u2192 Stir gently for 2-3 minutes. Let rest 5 minutes.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 PHASE 3: TOP NOTES (sparkle) \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  Step 19. Add Grapefruit FCF (3.37%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 20. Add Geraniol (1.37%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 21. Add Bergamot FCF (4.08%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 22. Add Dihydromyrcenol (5.77%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 23. Add Linalool (1.68%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 24. Add Cedrat FCF oil Sicilian (1.92%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 25. Add Methyl Pamplemousse (1.45%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 26. Add Lavender EO (2.65%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 27. Add Floralozone (2.5%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  \u2192 Stir gently for 2-3 minutes. Let rest 5 minutes.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 MACERATION \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  Seal tightly and store in a cool, dark place.\n  Estimated maturation: 24 days minimum.\n  Check at day 7 for initial impressions.\n  Best results typically at day 24 \u2013 38."+  }+}\ No newline at end of filediff --git a/verification_runs/20260428-062031-andaman-mineral-fougere/wear_test_template.md b/verification_runs/20260428-062031-andaman-mineral-fougere/wear_test_template.mdnew file mode 100644index 0000000..728933b--- /dev/null+++ b/verification_runs/20260428-062031-andaman-miner