 | 820 | 0.820 |\n| 3 | Habanolide | neat | 410 | 0.410 |\n| 4 | Linalyl Acetate | neat | 342 | 0.342 |\n| 5 | Coumarin | 20% | 342 | 0.342 |\n| 6 | Bergamot FCF | neat | 318 | 0.318 |\n| 7 | Cedarwood oil Virginia | neat | 307 | 0.307 |\n| 8 | Hexyl Salicylate | neat | 273 | 0.273 |\n| 9 | Romandolide | neat | 239 | 0.239 |\n| 10 | Lavender EO | neat | 231 | 0.231 |\n| 11 | Clary Sage EO | neat | 205 | 0.205 |\n| 12 | Ethyl Linalool | neat | 205 | 0.205 |\n| 13 | Ambrox Super | 30% | 172 | 0.172 |\n| 14 | Vetiver EO | neat | 171 | 0.171 |\n| 15 | Galaxolide | 80% | 157 | 0.157 |\n| 16 | Dihydromyrcenol | neat | 144 | 0.144 |\n| 17 | Cedrat FCF oil Sicilian | neat | 130 | 0.130 |\n| 18 | Grapefruit FCF | neat | 115 | 0.115 |\n| 19 | Patchouli EO | neat | 102 | 0.102 |\n| 20 | Geraniol | neat | 99 | 0.099 |\n| 21 | Linalool | neat | 87 | 0.087 |\n| 22 | Evernyl | neat | 82 | 0.082 |\n| 23 | Aldehyde C12 MNA | 1% | 41 | 0.041 |\n| 24 | Cyclamen Aldehyde | neat | 29 | 0.029 |\n| 25 | cis-3-Hexenol | neat | 24 | 0.024 |\n| - | Concentrate rounding adjustment | - | -1 | -0.001 |\n| - | **Fragrance concentrate subtotal** | - | **6000** | **6.000** |\n| - | Ethanol 96% bottle fill | neat | **24000** | **24.000** |\n| - | **Final bottle total** | - | **30000** | **30.000** |\n\n### Family OAV Envelope\n\n| Window | Optimized family OAV |\n|---|---|\n| top | `citrus`=1822.2, `fresh`=772.3, `aromatic`=197.9, `green`=24.0, `radiance`=5.2, `wood`=3.8, `sparkle`=3.3, `geranium`=3.1 |\n| heart | `fresh`=3683.6, `aromatic`=901.1, `citrus`=802.0, `radiance`=40.7, `wood`=30.4, `green`=29.0, `sparkle`=24.0, `geranium`=22.4 |\n| base | `radiance`=45.4, `aromatic`=42.4, `wood`=38.5, `green`=20.2, `amber`=18.6, `musk`=18.5, `sparkle`=10.7, `moss`=10.5 |\n\n### Vapor ppm / ODT / OAV Leaders\n\n**top window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Grapefruit FCF | 7.090460 | 0.005000 | 1418.1 |\n| Dihydromyrcenol | 0.772329 | 0.001000 | 772.3 |\n| Bergamot FC