ndarin-lavender, apple-tonka, polished woods.*\n\n**Market logic:** Uses the Layton lesson, not the Layton family: a small fruity-spiced hook over a real lavender-coumarin-moss fougere body, with sweetness capped for heat.\n\n**Optimizer score:** `-68.609 -> -44.208` (`+24.401`)\n\n### Optimized Formula - 30 mL EDP\n\n| # | Material | Dilution | Amount (uL) | Amount (mL) |\n|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 1 | Hedione | neat | 844 | 0.844 |\n| 2 | Iso E Super | neat | 676 | 0.676 |\n| 3 | Coumarin | 20% | 406 | 0.406 |\n| 4 | Linalyl Acetate | neat | 338 | 0.338 |\n| 5 | Habanolide | neat | 338 | 0.338 |\n| 6 | Lavender EO | neat | 281 | 0.281 |\n| 7 | Bergamot FCF | neat | 228 | 0.228 |\n| 8 | Ethyl Linalool | neat | 203 | 0.203 |\n| 9 | Cedarwood oil Virginia | neat | 203 | 0.203 |\n| 10 | Sandalore | neat | 203 | 0.203 |\n| 11 | Ambrox Super | 30% | 203 | 0.203 |\n| 12 | Romandolide | neat | 203 | 0.203 |\n| 13 | Ethylene Brassylate | neat | 203 | 0.203 |\n| 14 | Vanillin | 10% | 169 | 0.169 |\n| 15 | Clary Sage EO | neat | 149 | 0.149 |\n| 16 | Red Mandarin EO | neat | 143 | 0.143 |\n| 17 | Apritone | 10% | 135 | 0.135 |\n| 18 | Geraniol | neat | 135 | 0.135 |\n| 19 | Vetiver EO | neat | 135 | 0.135 |\n| 20 | Patchouli EO | neat | 135 | 0.135 |\n| 21 | Dihydromyrcenol | neat | 114 | 0.114 |\n| 22 | Hexyl Acetate | 10% | 101 | 0.101 |\n| 23 | Grapefruit FCF | neat | 86 | 0.086 |\n| 24 | Citronellol | neat | 68 | 0.068 |\n| 25 | Evernyl | neat | 68 | 0.068 |\n| 26 | Ethyl Vanillin | neat | 68 | 0.068 |\n| 27 | Linalool | neat | 63 | 0.063 |\n| 28 | Cyclamen Aldehyde | neat | 31 | 0.031 |\n| 29 | Aldehyde C12 MNA | 1% | 30 | 0.030 |\n| 30 | cis-3-Hexenol | neat | 17 | 0.017 |\n| 31 | Citral | neat | 17 | 0.017 |\n| 32 | Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate | neat | 7 | 0.007 |\n| - | **Fragrance concentrate subtotal** | - | **6000** | **6.000** |\n| - | Ethanol 96% bottle fill | neat | **24000** | **24.000** |\n| - | **Final bottle total** | - | **30000** | **30.000** |\n\n### Family OAV Envelope\n\n| Window | Optimized family OAV |\n|---|---|\n| top | `citrus`=2143.1, `fresh`=614.4, `fruity`=228.4, `aromatic`=183.2, `green`=18.5, `geranium`=6.7, `radiance`=4.6, `wood`=3.1 |\n| heart | `fresh`=2887.4, `fruity`=1560.4, `aromatic`=818.6, `citrus`=370.1, `geranium`=47.1, `radiance`=35.7, `green`=31.3, `wood`=24.3 |\n| base | `fruity`=342.0, `radiance`=40.1, `aromatic`=36.1, `wood`=31.1, `green`=22.0, `amber`=21.9, `musk`=16.4, `geranium`=13.7 |\n\n### Vapor ppm / ODT / OAV Leaders\n\n**top window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Grapefruit FCF | 5.287915 | 0.005000 | 1057.6 |\n| Red Mandarin EO | 8.813192 | 0.010000 | 881.3 |\n| Dihydromyrcenol | 0.614386 | 0.001000 | 614.4 |\n| Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate | 0.013560 | 0.000060 | 226.0 |\n| Bergamot FCF | 3.053372 | 0.015000 | 203.6 |\n| Lavender EO | 1.803646 | 0.020000 | 90.2 |\n| Linalool | 0.428872 | 0.006000 | 71.5 |\n| cis-3-Hexenol | 1.000650 | 0.070000 | 14.3 |\n\n**heart window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Dihydromyrcenol | 2.887364 | 0.001000 | 2887.4 |\n| Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate | 0.092518 | 0.000060 | 1542.0 |\n| Lavender EO | 7.640076 | 0.020000 | 382.0 |\n| Bergamot FCF | 5.482911 | 0.015000 | 365.5 |\n| Linalool | 1.733980 | 0.006000 | 289.0 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 1.277821 | 0.015000 | 85.2 |\n| Linalyl Acetate | 2.904138 | 0.050000 | 58.1 |\n| Hedione | 0.713802 | 0.020000 | 35.7 |\n\n**base window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate | 0.019617 | 0.000060 | 326.9 |\n| Hedione | 0.801308 | 0.020000 | 40.1 |\n| Cyclamen Aldehyde | 0.077101 | 0.003500 | 22.0 |\n| Ambrox Super | 0.006558 | 0.000300 | 21.9 |\n| Iso E Super | 0.212222 | 0.010000 | 21.2 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 0.270938 | 0.015000 | 18.1 |\n| Hexyl Acetate | 0.029852 | 0.002000 | 14.9 |\n| Habanolide | 0.014616 | 0.001000 | 14.6 |\n\n### Mixing Order\n\n1. Add musks, woods, moss, coumarin, and low