ity`=10.2, `floral`=7.9, `wood`=7.2, `radiance`=5.6 |\n| heart | `fresh`=8945.7, `aromatic`=794.1, `citrus`=648.8, `marine`=471.2, `floral`=59.0, `wood`=57.8, `fruity`=57.7, `radiance`=44.5 |\n| base | `marine`=290.3, `wood`=70.2, `radiance`=49.3, `floral`=40.8, `amber`=28.2, `aromatic`=19.8, `musk`=12.9, `cushion`=8.0 |\n\n### Vapor ppm / ODT / OAV Leaders\n\n**top window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Grapefruit FCF | 12.460691 | 0.005000 | 2492.1 |\n| Dihydromyrcenol | 1.861416 | 0.001000 | 1861.4 |\n| Bergamot FCF | 3.276344 | 0.015000 | 218.4 |\n| Linalool | 0.689055 | 0.006000 | 114.8 |\n| Cedrat FCF oil Sicilian | 1.313581 | 0.012000 | 109.5 |\n| Calone | 0.000594 | 0.000010 | 59.4 |\n| Lavender EO | 1.016715 | 0.020000 | 50.8 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 0.214931 | 0.015000 | 14.3 |\n\n**heart window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Dihydromyrcenol | 8.945677 | 0.001000 | 8945.7 |\n| Linalool | 2.842729 | 0.006000 | 473.8 |\n| Calone | 0.004531 | 0.000010 | 453.1 |\n| Bergamot FCF | 5.912003 | 0.015000 | 394.1 |\n| Cedrat FCF oil Sicilian | 3.055906 | 0.012000 | 254.7 |\n| Lavender EO | 4.397553 | 0.020000 | 219.9 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 1.506675 | 0.015000 | 100.4 |\n| Methyl Pamplemousse | 0.173038 | 0.003000 | 57.7 |\n\n**base window**\n\n| Material | Vapor ppm | ODT ppm | OAV |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Calone | 0.002864 | 0.000010 | 286.4 |\n| Hedione | 0.986321 | 0.020000 | 49.3 |\n| Iso E Super | 0.306208 | 0.010000 | 30.6 |\n| Ambrox Super | 0.008472 | 0.000300 | 28.2 |\n| Cashmeran | 0.048029 | 0.002000 | 24.0 |\n| Hydroxycitronellal | 0.345231 | 0.015000 | 23.0 |\n| Clary Sage EO | 0.295494 | 0.015000 | 19.7 |\n| Nympheal | 0.035493 | 0.002000 | 17.7 |\n\n### Mixing Order\n\n1. Add musks, woods, moss, coumarin, and low-volatility materials first.\n2. Add Hedione/radiance and geranium-floral materials.\n3. Add lavender, clary, linalool/linalyl materials.\n4. Add citrus, fresh, marine,